Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Agent Leland Turbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a flash transmission for Agent Finn McMissile.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finn，my cover's been compromised。Everything's gone pear-shaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.93,0:00:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You won't believe what I found out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is bigger than anything we've ever seen，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.17,0:01:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,and no one even knows it exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finn，I need backup，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,but don't call the cavalry，it could blow the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.51,0:01:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,And be careful。It's not safe out here。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Transmitting my grids now。Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，buddy，we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.35,0:01:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right where you paid me to bring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Question is，why？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:01:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,A car？Ha！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:02:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，pal，you can't get any further away from land than out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly where I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.13,0:02:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got news for you，buddy。There's nobody out here but us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,What does it look like，genius？I'm crabbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，turn around and go back where you came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.38,0:02:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，and who's gonna make me？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.55,0:02:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。All right。Don't get your prop in a twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.19,0:02:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a jerk。Sorry，buddy。Looks like it's the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.19,0:02:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Buddy？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Incoming。All workers report to the loading dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leland Turbo，this is Finn McMissile
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,.I'm at the rally point。Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，fellas，you know the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leland，it's Finn。Please respond。Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.67,0:03:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，guys。These crates aren't gonna unload themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Too many cars here。Out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Zedapp？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here it is，Professor。You wanted to see this before we load it？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，yes。Very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，a TV camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What does it actually do？- This camera is extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you up to now，Professor？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.47,0:04:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is valuable equipment。Make sure it is properly secured for the voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You got it。- Hey，Professor Z！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is one of those British spies we told you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！This one we caught sticking his bumper where it didn't belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Agent Leland Turbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Finn McMissile！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's seen the camera！Kill him！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,All hands on deck！All hands on deck！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Waargh！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.78,0:06:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get to the boats！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:07:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's getting away！- Not for long！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's dead，Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wunderbar！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,With Finn McMissile gone，who can stop us now？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater-Tow Mater，that's who is here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Otis！- Hey，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.51,0:07:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I… Oh，gosh。I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.05,0:07:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought I could make it this time，but…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smooth like pudding，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who am I kidding？I'll always be a lemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，dad-gum，you're leaking oil again。Must be your gaskets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，but look on the bright side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is your tenth tow this month，so it's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the only one that's nice to lemons like me，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.57,0:08:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it。Shoot，these things happen to everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But you never leak oil。- Yeah，but I ain't perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.41,0:08:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't tell nobody，but I think my rust is starting to show through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Is Lightning McQueen back yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must be crazy excited about winning his fourth Piston Cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four！Wow！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.09,0:08:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，we're so dad-gum proud of him，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I wish he'd hurry up and get back，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.86,0:08:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,'cause we got a whole summer's worth of best friend fun to make up for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just me and…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Whoa，whoa，whoa！- McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater！I'm in no hurry！- Hey，everybody。McQueen's back！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:08:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Aaah！- McQueen's back！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.11,0:09:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- McQueen's back！McQueen's back！- Aaah！Oooh-hoo！Oooh-hah！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.18,0:09:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen's back！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Lightning！Welcome home！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.62,0:09:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good to have you back，honey！- Congratulations，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.25,0:09:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome home，soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,The place wasn't the same without you，son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Did he go somewhere？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's good to be home，everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater！- McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.93,0:09:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater！- McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.30,0:09:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oooh！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoooa！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.41,0:09:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，how far did you make it this time，Otis？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Halfway to the county line。- Ooh，not bad，man！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.85,0:09:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know！I can't believe it either！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.51,0:09:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- McQueen！Welcome back！- Mater，it's so good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You too，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，man，you ain't going to believe the things I got planned for us！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,These best friend greetings get longer every year！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.83,0:09:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You ready to have some serious fun？- I've got something to show you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.43,0:09:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.73,0:10:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe they renamed the Piston Cup
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.23,0:10:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,after our very own Doc Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know Doc said these things were just old cups，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.94,0:10:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,but to have someone else win it just didn't feel right，you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doc would've been real proud of you。That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，pal。I've been waiting all summer for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What you got planned？- Ho-ho-ho！You sure you can handle it？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know who you're talking to？This is Lightning McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can handle anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Er… Mater？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just remember，your brakes ain't going to work on these！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.57,0:10:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater？- Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.57,0:10:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,These train tracks ain't been used in years！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aaaah！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Aaaah！- Faster，faster。Come on。Here we go！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Faster！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ooh。Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.59,0:10:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I don't know。Do you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is going to be good！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you see that？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.81,0:11:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh-oh。This ain't going to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.61,0:11:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha-ha！Boy，this was the best day ever！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.71,0:11:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,And my favorite souvenir，this new dent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.15,0:11:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Boy，Mater，today was ah… - Shoot，that was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.86,0:11:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait till you see what I got planned for tonight！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，Mater，whoa！I was thinking of just a quiet dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.60,0:11:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I was thinkin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，I meant with Sally，Mater。- Even better！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You，me and Miss Sally goin' out for supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，I meant it would be just me and Sally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.18,0:11:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh。- You know，just for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh… - We'll do whatever you want tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.45,0:11:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.75,0:11:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks for understanding。- Yeah，sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.25,0:12:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Y'all go on and have fun now。- All right，then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you soon，amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.47,0:12:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，this is so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.63,0:12:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't tell you how good it is to be here alone，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,just the two of us，finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.61,0:12:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You and me。- Ahem！Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh！- My name is Mater，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I'll be your waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater the waiter。That's funny right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater？You work here？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I work here。What'd you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I snuck in here when nobody was lookin'…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.39,0:12:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,and pretended to be your waiter…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,so I could hang out with you？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah。How ridiculous would that be？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.99,0:12:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I start you two lovebirds off with a couple of drinks？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。I'll have my usual。- You know what？I'll have that，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh… Right。Your usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks，man。- Grazie，Guido.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guido，what's McQueen's usual？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,How should I know？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.65,0:13:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Perfect。Give me two of them。- Quiet！My program's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.75,0:13:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tonight on the Mel Dorado Show…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.12,0:13:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,His story gripped the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.03,0:13:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oil billionaire Miles Axlerod，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,in an attempt to become the first car to circumnavigate the globe without GPS，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,ironically ran out of gas，and found himself trapped in the wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Feared dead，he emerged 36 days later，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,running on a fuel he distilled himself from the natural elements！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.47,0:13:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since then，he's sold his oil fortune，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,converted himself from a gas-guzzler into an electric car
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,and has devoted his life to finding a renewable，clean-burning fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now he claims to have done it with his allinol.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.99,0:13:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,And to show the world what his new super fuel can do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,he's created a racing competition like no other，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,inviting the greatest champions
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,to battle in the first ever World Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome，Sir Miles Axlerod.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Mel。It is good to be here。Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.07,0:13:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Big oil。It costs a fortune。Pollution is getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:14:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，it's a fossil fuel。「Fossil，」 as in dead dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we all know what happened to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.61,0:14:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alternative energy is the future。Trust me，Mel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,After seeing allinol in action at the World Grand Prix，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.51,0:14:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,nobody will ever go back to gasoline again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.35,0:14:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened to the dinosaurs，now？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.72,0:14:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,And on satellite，a World Grand Prix competitor
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,and one of the fastest cars in the world，Francesco Bernoulli.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is an honor，Signore Dorado，for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why not invite Lightning McQueen？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course we invited him，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.63,0:14:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,but apparently after his very long racing season
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,he is taking time off to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.24,0:14:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Lightning McQueen would not have a chance against Francesco.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.77,0:14:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can go over 300 kilometers an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,In miles，that is like… way faster than McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.01,0:14:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go to the phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Baltimore，Maryland，you're on the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Am I on？Hello？- You're on。Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.39,0:14:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello？- Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go to Radiator Springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.19,0:14:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're on，caller.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,That Italian feller you got on there
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:14:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,can't talk that way about Lightning McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.19,0:15:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's the bestest race car in the whole wide world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Uh- oh。- If he is，how you say，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「the bestest race car」，then why must he rest？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.40,0:15:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause he knows what's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every now and then he prefers just to slow down，enjoy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！You heard it！Lightning McQueen prefers to be slow！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is not news to Francesco.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.78,0:15:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I want to go to sleep，I watch one of his races.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.18,0:15:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,After two laps，I am out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.85,0:15:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,That ain't what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.62,0:15:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on over there？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,He is afraid of Francesco.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's that Italian formula car.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- His name is… - Francesco Bernoulli.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.97,0:15:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No wonder there's a crowd。- Why do you know his name？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.44,0:15:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,And don't say it like that。It's three syllables，not ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.37,0:15:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？He's nice to look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.76,0:15:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，open-wheeled and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.87,0:15:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong with fenders？I thought you liked my fenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let me tell you something else。- Mater？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen could drive circles around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.42,0:15:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Driving in circles is all he can-a do，no？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.48,0:15:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.59,0:16:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，yes。I mean，he could beat you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any time，any track.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mel，can we move on？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.59,0:16:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Francesco needs a caller who can provide
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.53,0:16:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,a little more intellectual stimulation，like a dump truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha-ha！That shows what you know。Dump trucks is dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，hi。This is Lightning McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.74,0:16:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Lightning McQueen，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't appreciate my best friend being insulted like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen，that was your best friend？Oh！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.11,0:16:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the difference between you and Francesco.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Francesco knows how good he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.68,0:16:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,He does not need to surround himself with tow trucks to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.05,0:16:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those are strong words from a car that is so fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fragile！He calls Francesco fragile！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not-a so fast，McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Not so fast。」 Is that your new motto？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.87,0:16:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Motto？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.90,0:16:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This sounds like something that needs to be settled on the race course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.91,0:16:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you say，Lightning McQueen？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:16:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got room for one more racer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.14,0:17:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would love to，but my crew is off for the season，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pit stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？They just got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.95,0:17:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deal me in，baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ka-chow！Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know，I know。I just got back，but we won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，don't worry about me。I've got enough to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater's going to have a blast，though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're bringing Mater，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You never bring him to any of your races.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.31,0:17:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just let him sit in the pits。Give him a headset.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，it will be the thrill of a lifetime for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your drink，sir。- Mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't taste it！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,How'd you like to come and see the world with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You mean it？- Yeah。You got me into this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're coming along。- All right！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:17:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ka-chow！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.57,0:18:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha-ha！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.40,0:18:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha-ha！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，excuse me！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.05,0:19:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Domo arigato！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.49,0:20:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guido，look。Ferraris and tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's go！- Ho- ho！Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.16,0:20:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，now，Mater，remember，best behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.47,0:20:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You got it，buddy。Hey，what's that？- Mater！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，McQueen！Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lewis！- Hey，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.47,0:20:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jeff！- Hey，Lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you believe this party？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.28,0:20:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.55,0:20:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You done good。You got all the leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.85,0:20:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Check out that tow truck。- Man，I wonder who that guy's with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.45,0:20:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah… Will you guys excuse me just for one little second？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ho-ho！Good job！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.19,0:20:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater！Listen，this isn't Radiator Springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.90,0:20:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're just realizing that？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh-ho！That jet lag really done a number on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.73,0:20:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，things are different over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which means maybe you should，you know，act a little different，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.61,0:20:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Different than what？- Well，just help me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.51,0:21:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need help？Shoot！Why didn't you say so？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what a tow truck does.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.15,0:21:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，I mean… - Looky there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Mr。San Francisco。I'll introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.69,0:21:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater，no！- Look at me。I'm helping you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Mr。San Francisco，I'd like you to meet…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.19,0:21:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，Lightning McQueen！Buona sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.43,0:21:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nice to meet you，Francesco。- Nice to meet you，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.33,0:21:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are very good-looking。Not as good as I thought，but good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.23,0:21:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me。Can I get a picture with you？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.20,0:21:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything for McQueen's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss Sally is going to flip when she sees this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's Lightning McQueen's girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.61,0:21:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oooh！- She's a big fan of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，she has a good taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.78,0:21:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater's prone to exaggeration。I wouldn't say she's a 「big fan」.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're right。She's a huge fan！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.72,0:21:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,She goes on and on about your open wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mentioning it once doesn't qualify as going on and on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Francesco is familiar with this reaction to Francesco.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.66,0:21:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Women respect a car that has a nothing to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.83,0:21:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，er…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.47,0:21:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let us have a toast。- Let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:22:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I dedicate my win tomorrow to Miss Sally.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.17,0:22:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.27,0:22:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I already dedicated my win tomorrow to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，if we both do it，it's really not so special.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.05,0:22:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Besides，I don't have a drink。- I'll go get you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.58,0:22:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I borrow a few bucks for one of them drinks？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.09,0:22:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're free。- Free？Shoot，what am I doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.59,0:22:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should probably go keep an eye on him。See you at the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.69,0:22:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，you will see Francesco，but not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will see him like a this as he drives away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.47,0:22:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha！That's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.07,0:22:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,You had one of those made up for all the racers？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.47,0:22:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.07,0:22:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ciao，McQueen！- He is so getting beat tomorrow！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.68,0:22:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlecars，Sir Miles Axlerod.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.38,0:22:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is my absolute honor to introduce to you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.19,0:22:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,the competitors in the first ever World Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,From Brazil，Number 8…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.14,0:23:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，hello。- Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.91,0:23:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,A Volkswagen Karmann Ghia has no radiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.61,0:23:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's because it's air cooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.42,0:23:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great。I'm Agent Shiftwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.42,0:23:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holley Shiftwell from the Tokyo station.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.22,0:23:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I have a message from London。- Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.32,0:23:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try the canap on the mezzanine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,The lab boys analyzed the photo I sent？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.29,0:23:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did they learn about the camera？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.03,0:23:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,It appears to be a standard television camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.30,0:23:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,They said if you could get closer photos next time that would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.54,0:23:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This was London's message？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.91,0:23:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no。No，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.24,0:23:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,The oil platforms you were on，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,turns out they're sitting on the biggest oil reserve in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.05,0:23:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did we miss that？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.35,0:23:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,They've scrambled everyone's satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.45,0:23:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Americans discovered it just before you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.75,0:23:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,They placed an agent on that platform under deep cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was able to get a photo of the car
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.08,0:24:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,who's running the entire operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.99,0:24:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.09,0:24:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is it？Has anyone seen the photo yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nope，not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.06,0:24:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,The American is here tonight to pass it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.87,0:24:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll signal you when he's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.50,0:24:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good，good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.87,0:24:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.07,0:24:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What is it？- Change of plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.07,0:24:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're meeting the American。- What？Me？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.08,0:24:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those thugs down there were on the oil platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.38,0:24:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,If they see me，the mission is compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.51,0:24:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm technical。I'm in diagnostics.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.87,0:24:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm… I'm not a field agent
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.65,0:24:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.96,0:24:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take one of them。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.79,0:24:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never know which one McQueen will have a hankering for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.30,0:24:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。What you got here that's free？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.21,0:24:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about that pistachio ice cream？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.60,0:24:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，no，wasabi。- Same old same old.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.11,0:24:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's up with you？That looks delicious！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.51,0:25:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Er… little more，please。It is free，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.98,0:25:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep it coming。A little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.19,0:25:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，let's go。It's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.95,0:25:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gettin' there。Scoop，scoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.86,0:25:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,There ya go！Now that's a scoop of ice cream！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.66,0:25:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,My condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now our last competitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.76,0:25:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Number 95，Lightning McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.47,0:25:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ka-chow！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for having us，Sir Axlerod.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.54,0:25:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really look forward to racing。This is a great opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.08,0:25:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，the pleasure is all ours，Lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.55,0:25:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You and your team bring excellence and professionalism
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.75,0:25:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,to this competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.89,0:25:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody get me water！Aah！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.16,0:25:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，sweet relief。Sweet relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.10,0:25:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever you do，do not eat the free pistachio ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.44,0:25:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,It has turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.47,0:26:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir Axlerod，I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.84,0:26:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This is Mater。He's… - I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.68,0:26:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the bloke that called in to the television show.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.32,0:26:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're the one I have to thank。- No，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.18,0:26:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,This trip's been amazin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.92,0:26:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah。He's a little excited，isn't he？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.42,0:26:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater！- But wait，I… Oh，shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.86,0:26:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater。- Has anyone got a towel？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.19,0:26:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，get a hold of yourself。You're making a scene！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.80,0:26:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But I never leak oil。Never。- Go take care of yourself right now！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.91,0:26:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Comin' through！Leakin' oil。Where's the bathroom？Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.04,0:26:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta go。Oh，er…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.08,0:26:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Er…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.18,0:26:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.28,0:26:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm leakin'。I never leak。I never leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.25,0:26:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never leak，I never leak，I never leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.06,0:26:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，oh，I never leak。Oooh！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.03,0:26:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never leak，I never leak，never…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.13,0:26:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow-wee！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,What in the？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.02,0:27:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，that tickles！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.65,0:27:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Waaargh！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.83,0:27:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，McMissile。I'm here。It's time for the drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.30,0:27:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，so，the American has activated his tracking beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.87,0:27:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roger that。Move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.09,0:27:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.68,0:28:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，you've got to be joking。- What's the problem？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.21,0:28:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's in the loo。- So，go in！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.11,0:28:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I can't go into the men's loo！- Time is of the essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.88,0:28:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.29,0:28:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Whatever you do，I would not go in there！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.90,0:28:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！A Gremlin and a Pacer！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.57,0:28:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,No offense to your makes and models，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.24,0:28:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you break down harder than my cousin Betsy
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.01,0:28:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,after she got left at the altar！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.97,0:28:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the？Whoa。Are you OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.34,0:28:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm fine。- Hey！Tow truck！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.51,0:28:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'd like to get to our private business here，if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.05,0:28:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah，sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.62,0:28:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't let me get in the way of your private business.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.22,0:29:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，a little advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.36,0:29:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you hear a giggle and see that waterfall，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.06,0:29:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,you best press that green button.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.03,0:29:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you。- It's to adjust the temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.26,0:29:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Got it。- And it's in Celsius，not Fahrenheit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.96,0:29:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out of here！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.47,0:29:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，then。And when she starts gigglin'，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.05,0:29:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,prepare to be squirted.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.44,0:29:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Scuse me，ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.41,0:29:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad gum pistachio ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.41,0:29:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This cannot be him。Is he American？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.15,0:29:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out，ladies。Mater's fittin' to get funky.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.58,0:29:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Extremely。- Then it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.55,0:29:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello。- Well，hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.15,0:29:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,A Volkswagen Karmann Ghia has no radiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.89,0:29:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，of course it doesn't。That's 'cause it's air- cooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.59,0:29:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perfect。Erm… I'm from the Tokyo Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.43,0:29:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Course，Karmann Ghias weren't the only ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.23,0:29:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides the Beetles，you had Type 3 Squarebacks with the Pancake motors.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.10,0:29:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，OK。I get it。- And before both of them
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.50,0:29:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,there's the Type 2 buses.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.30,0:29:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- My buddy Fillmore's one of them。- Listen！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.57,0:29:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Erm… We should find somewhere more private.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.24,0:29:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gee，don't you think that's a little？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.24,0:30:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're right。Impossible to know which areas here are compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.41,0:30:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So，when can I see you again？- Well，let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.68,0:30:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tomorrow I'll be out there at the races。- Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.59,0:30:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll rendezvous then.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.12,0:30:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There you are。Where have you been？- What's a 「rendezvous」？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.03,0:30:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Er… It's like a date。- A date？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.89,0:30:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，what's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.43,0:30:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on is I got me a date tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.26,0:30:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guido don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.27,0:30:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Believe it。My new girlfriend just said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.44,0:30:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，there she is。Hey！Hey，lady！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.51,0:30:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.48,0:30:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guido still don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.01,0:30:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I got to admit，you tricked us real good。- And we don't like being tricked.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.95,0:30:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's so funny？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.89,0:30:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I was just wearing a disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.42,0:30:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys are stuck looking like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.56,0:30:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Allinol？Thanks，fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.32,0:30:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hear this stuff is good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.23,0:30:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.10,0:30:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Allinol by itself is good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.70,0:30:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,But after microscopic examination
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.14,0:31:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have found that it has one small weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.91,0:31:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,When hit with an electromagnetic pulse，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.81,0:31:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,it becomes extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.92,0:31:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smile for the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.88,0:31:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that all you want？I got a whole act.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.99,0:31:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were very interested
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.65,0:31:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,in this camera on the oil platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.59,0:31:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，you will witness what it really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.66,0:31:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Whatever you say，Professor。- You talked up a lot of cars last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.36,0:31:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Which one's your associate？- Your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.70,0:31:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，I'm sorry，it was your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.88,0:31:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't tell them apart these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.34,0:31:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could I start it now，Professor Z？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.21,0:31:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go 50？power.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.48,0:31:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,This camera is actually an electromagnetic pulse emitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.28,0:31:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about her？Did you give it to her？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.32,0:31:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,The allinol is now heating to a boil，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.72,0:31:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,dramatically expanding，causing the engine block to crack under the stress，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.69,0:31:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,forcing oil into the combustion chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.23,0:31:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about him？Did you talk to him？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.56,0:31:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do I care？I can replace an engine block.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.93,0:32:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You may be able to，but after full impact of the pulse…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.34,0:32:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,unfortunately… there will be nothing to replace.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.44,0:32:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about him？Does he have it？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.98,0:32:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's him。He's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.42,0:32:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Roger that，Professor Z。- No！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.38,0:32:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.55,0:32:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,We believe the infiltrator has passed along sensitive information.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.92,0:32:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will take care of it before any damage can be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.23,0:32:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,The project is still on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.96,0:32:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will find the second agent and kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.08,0:32:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Japan，land of the rising sun，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.21,0:32:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,where ancient tradition meets modern technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.85,0:32:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome to the inaugural running of the World Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.75,0:32:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Brent Mustangburger
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.80,0:32:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,with racing legends
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.95,0:32:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Darrell Cartrip and David Hobbscap.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.09,0:32:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's never been a competition like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.72,0:33:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,First，allinol，making its debut tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.09,0:33:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,as the required fuel for all these great champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.23,0:33:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Second，the course itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.16,0:33:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it's like nothing we've ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.63,0:33:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,David，how exactly does this competition work？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.20,0:33:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,All three of these street courses are classic round the house racetracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.57,0:33:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,This means that the LMP and formula cars
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.57,0:33:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,should break out of the gate in spectacular fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.07,0:33:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look for Francesco Bernoulli，in particular，to lead early.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.01,0:33:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,And with technical turns throughout，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.24,0:33:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,GT and touring cars，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.05,0:33:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,like Spain's Miguel Camino，should make up ground
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.58,0:33:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I doubt it'll be enough to stop Francesco
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.65,0:33:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,from absolutely running away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.59,0:33:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa now。Hold your horsepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.22,0:33:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You forget the most important factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.16,0:33:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,that early dirt track section of the course.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.13,0:33:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,The dirt is supposed to be the equalizer in this race.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.20,0:33:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,French rally car Raoul Roule
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.47,0:33:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,is counting on a big boost through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.67,0:33:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And don't forget Lightning McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.70,0:33:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,His mentor，the Hudson Hornet，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.44,0:33:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,was one of the greatest dirt track racers of all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.14,0:33:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,In my opinion，McQueen is the best all around racer in this competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.01,0:33:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really，Darrell，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.89,0:33:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,you need to clean your windshield.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.45,0:34:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're clearly not seeing this for what it is：
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.19,0:34:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Francesco's race to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.25,0:34:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's time to find out。The racers are locking into the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.66,0:34:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Speed。I am speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.87,0:34:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？You are speed？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.30,0:34:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then Francesco is triple speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.34,0:34:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Francesco is triple speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ho-ho！Francesco likes a this McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.91,0:34:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a really getting him into the zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.91,0:34:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,He is so getting beat today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.61,0:35:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your suspension sets look good。- Tire pressure is excellent！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.55,0:35:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's got plenty of fuel。- And he's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.99,0:35:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why is he in the pits？He's so exposed。- It's his cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.56,0:35:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of the best I've seen，too。Look at the detail on that rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.73,0:35:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,It must have cost him a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.20,0:35:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But why hasn't he contacted us yet？- There's probably heat on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.40,0:35:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Be patient。- Right，of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.40,0:35:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He'll signal us when he can。- Then we find out who's behind all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.71,0:35:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,As they head into the palace hairpin，Francesco builds an early lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.24,0:35:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on，boys。Here comes the dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.85,0:35:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slipping and sliding，baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.51,0:35:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen，it's time to make your move！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.48,0:35:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get on the outside and show 'im what Doc taught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.02,0:35:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,10-4，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.36,0:35:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，boy！Francesco's brought to a screeching halt！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.36,0:36:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightning McQueen is the first to take advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.03,0:36:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,And just like that，folks，Francesco's lead is left in the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.20,0:36:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice call，Mater。Keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.10,0:36:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo-hoo！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.67,0:36:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen looks happier than a roll bar at a demolition derby！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.44,0:36:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone's jostling for position as we hit the asphalt again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.68,0:36:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Francesco lost a lot of momentum in the dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.62,0:36:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got serious work ahead of him if he wants to get back in this race.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.63,0:36:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,The racers hit the Rainbow Bridge，with its 360-degree loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.41,0:36:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It is time。- Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.19,0:36:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Miguel Camino has blown an engine！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.69,0:37:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very unusual，Darrell。He's been so consistent all year.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.69,0:37:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You gotta be kidding me。- What is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.49,0:37:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The tow truck from the bathroom。- The bathroom？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.86,0:37:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,The one the American agent passed the device to.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.20,0:37:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What about him？- He's in the pits！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.60,0:37:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.31,0:37:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hold on。I think I've got something。- What is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.46,0:37:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Pacer from the party last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.84,0:37:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm cross referencing with the photos from the oil derricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.05,0:37:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yep。His VIN numbers match.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.78,0:37:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyone with him？He won't be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.62,0:37:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Conducting analysis on the target。He's not the only one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.72,0:37:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three，five… They're everywhere。And they're all closing in on…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.96,0:37:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！Finn？Finn，where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.03,0:37:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get him out of the pits。Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.73,0:37:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow！Some of them fellers is really loud！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.66,0:37:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can you hear me？Over。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.13,0:37:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out of the pit now！Do you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.90,0:37:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。I know you！You're that girl from the party last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.47,0:37:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wanna do our date now？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.31,0:37:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys，too much chatter。Let's keep this line clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.34,0:37:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smoke from number 10，Clutchgoneski！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.38,0:38:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.65,0:38:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no time for messing about！Get out of the pits！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.85,0:38:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there going to be cable where you is so I can watch the rest of the race？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.39,0:38:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're running out of time！- They're coming。Get him out of there！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.66,0:38:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm trying。Get out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.06,0:38:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I usually like to have a proper detailin' done before I meet a lady friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.10,0:38:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.54,0:38:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Finn McMissile！But you're dead！- Then this shouldn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.15,0:38:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss Shiftwell？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.69,0:38:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got him in the back alleys east of the garages.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.09,0:38:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Multiple assailants are closing in quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.53,0:38:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep him moving。I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.83,0:38:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，new lady friend，you like flowers？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.97,0:38:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.03,0:38:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Don't go in anywhere。Just keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.60,0:38:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stay outside。Got you。- Outside？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.77,0:39:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！McQueen suddenly moves to the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.38,0:39:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I cannot believe what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.18,0:39:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was a bonehead move to open up the inside like that！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.15,0:39:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,That might have cost McQueen the victory！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.17,0:39:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This time，I'm going to make sure you stay dead！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.01,0:39:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're doing brilliantly。Now just stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.48,0:39:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？You want me to head toward that ruckus？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.05,0:39:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Don't go down that street.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.35,0:39:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ohh！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.86,0:39:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi-yah！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.13,0:39:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow！A live karate demonstration！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.46,0:39:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it，Mater。Just sign off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.50,0:40:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aaargh！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.97,0:40:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,And here they come，the two leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.84,0:40:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bumper to bumper as they approach the finish line！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.25,0:40:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's close！- Francesco's the winner！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.48,0:40:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen's number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.42,0:40:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was cool！Can I get your autograph？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.86,0:40:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where'd he go？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.43,0:40:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our rendezvous has been jeopardized。Keep the device safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.47,0:40:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We'll be in touch。- Dad- gum，did I miss our date？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.24,0:40:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Francesco！- Francesco，over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.01,0:40:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was your strategy today？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.61,0:40:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Strategia？Francesco needs a no strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.48,0:40:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.72,0:40:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You start the race，wait for Lightning McQueen to choke，pass him，then win.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.86,0:40:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Francesco always- a wins。It's- a boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.26,0:41:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were in trouble for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.63,0:41:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,That dirt track section had you crawling.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.66,0:41:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,To truly crush one's dream，you must first raise their hopes very high.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.96,0:41:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,To truly crush one's dream，you must first raise their hopes very high.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.23,0:41:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater！- Hey，McQueen！What happened？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.17,0:41:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is the race over？You won，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.30,0:41:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why were you yelling at me while I was racing？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.77,0:41:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yelling？Oh，you thought… That's funny right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.74,0:41:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，that's 'cause I seen these two fellers doing
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.15,0:41:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,some karate street performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.32,0:41:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was nutso。One of 'em even had a flame thrower.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.88,0:41:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,A flame thrower？What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.45,0:41:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't understand。Where were you？- Going to meet my date.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.29,0:41:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your date？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.93,0:41:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,She started talkin' to me as a voice in my head，
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.69,0:41:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,tellin' me where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.10,0:41:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.30,0:41:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I didn't screw ya up，did I？- I lost the race because of you！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.00,0:41:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。I'm sorry。I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.57,0:41:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,An imaginary girlfriend？Flame throwers？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.71,0:41:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is exactly why I don't bring you along to these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.08,0:41:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe if I，I don't know，
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.28,0:41:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,talk to somebody and explained what happened，I could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.58,0:42:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't need your help！I don't want your help！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.15,0:42:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，there he is！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.72,0:42:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- McQueen，you had it in the bag！- Yeah！What happened？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.59,0:42:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.33,0:42:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I can assure you，it won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.16,0:42:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I can assure you，it won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.53,0:42:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，we know what the problem is and we've taken care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.97,0:42:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightning McQueen loses in the last lap to Francesco Bernoulli
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.34,0:42:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,in the first race of the World Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.91,0:42:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,And three count 'em three cars flamed out
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.81,0:42:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,leaving some to suggest that their fuel，allinol，might be to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.55,0:42:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Allinol is safe。Alternative fuel is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.05,0:42:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is no way my fuel caused these cars to flame out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.59,0:42:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,The jury may still be out on whether allinol caused these accidents，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.13,0:42:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,but one thing's for sure，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.56,0:42:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightning McQueen blew this race.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.13,0:42:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Team McQueen can't be happy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.61,0:43:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome to Tokyo International Airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.83,0:43:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come with me，please，sir。- But I'm 'onna miss my plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.80,0:43:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right this way。- Ah，doggone it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.67,0:43:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is about my hook，ain't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.64,0:43:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know I should have checked it，but I can't，really.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.64,0:43:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。It's attached to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.21,0:43:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I know you。You're that feller from the karate demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.65,0:43:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never properly introduced myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.02,0:43:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finn McMissile。British Intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.49,0:43:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tow Mater。Average intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.46,0:43:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you with？FBI？CIA？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.19,0:43:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's just say I'm AAA affiliated.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.29,0:43:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know some karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.63,0:44:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to brag or nuttin'，but I got me a black fan belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.23,0:44:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wanna see some moves I made up？- You're being followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.27,0:44:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,This first one，I can reach into a car's hood
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.24,0:44:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,pull out his battery，and show it to him before he stalls.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.08,0:44:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I call it，「What I accidentally did to my friend Luigi once。」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.31,0:44:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Hi-yah-pah！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.12,0:44:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi-yah！- There he is！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.95,0:44:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi-hi-tah！Huh！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.89,0:44:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I probably ought to go。I'm about to miss my flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.72,0:44:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't worry。I've taken care of that。- Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.06,0:44:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.90,0:44:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa-hah-hah！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.16,0:44:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is first class service.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.47,0:44:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't even have to go through the terminal！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.64,0:44:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your karate partners is back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.84,0:44:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,They look like they tryin' to catch up！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.11,0:44:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drive forward。Whatever you do，don't stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.28,0:44:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Whoa！- Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.33,0:45:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.80,0:45:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is everything okay back there？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.37,0:45:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finn，it's Sid。I'm on approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.54,0:45:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.18,0:45:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Member that whole thing about me not stoppin' no matter what？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.55,0:45:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew I shoulda done carry on！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.09,0:45:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，old boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.19,0:45:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You got it，mate。- Hey，doggonit！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.52,0:45:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，it's my imaginary girlfriend！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.52,0:45:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Get in here！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.16,0:45:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I tell you what，you really do want this first date，don't ya？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.96,0:45:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a no quit attitude right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.13,0:45:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.37,0:45:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Aargh！- Hold on，Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.15,0:45:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aargh！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.22,0:46:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Finn！It's now or never！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.76,0:46:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.70,0:46:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,By the time you read this，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.89,0:46:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will be safely on an airplane flying home.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.37,0:46:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,By the time you read this，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.21,0:46:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will be safely on an airplane flying home.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.70,0:46:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.44,0:46:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「I don't want to be the cause of you losing any more races.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.61,0:46:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,「I want you to go prove to the world what I already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.25,0:46:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,「That you are the greatest race car in the whole wide world.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.75,0:46:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Your best friend，Mater。」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.25,0:46:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't really want him to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.35,0:46:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，there's more here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.79,0:46:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,「PS。Please tell the hotel
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.59,0:46:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,「I didn't mean to order that movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.89,0:46:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,「I thought it was just a preview and I didn't realize I was paying for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.63,0:46:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,「PPS。That's funny right there。PP.」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.77,0:46:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are a few more pages of PS's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.67,0:46:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，at least I know if he's at home，he'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.41,0:47:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's how I like to start the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.41,0:47:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You never feel more alive than when you're almost dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.18,0:47:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I hope that device didn't fall off.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.28,0:47:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.62,0:47:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the closest I ever been to missin' my flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.39,0:47:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was… Oh！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.27,0:47:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was… Oh！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.69,0:47:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Still in one piece？Great。- I've got to go to a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.99,0:47:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I get these sharp pains in my undercarriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.43,0:47:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Downloading the photo now。- Let me introduce you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.70,0:47:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,This here is Finn McSomethin' or other.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.80,0:47:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's a first class VIP airport whatchamacallit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.37,0:47:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，Finn，this here is my date.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.11,0:47:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never did get your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.87,0:47:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes，sorry。It's Shiftwell。Holley Shiftwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.11,0:47:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Shiftwell。Holley…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.98,0:47:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finally。Time to see who's behind all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.45,0:47:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.38,0:47:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's one of the worst engines ever made.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.19,0:47:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's an old aluminum V8 with a Lucas electrical system
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.50,0:47:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,and Whitworth bolts.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.99,0:47:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shoot，them Whitworth bolts is a pain，tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.26,0:47:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Them ain't metric，they ain't inches.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.13,0:47:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，OK，but whose engine is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.90,0:48:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's kinda hard to tell from this picture，ain't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.53,0:48:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But you took it。- Holley.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.20,0:48:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。Right！Yes，of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.27,0:48:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,A good agent gets what he can，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.13,0:48:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,then gets out before he's killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.47,0:48:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Agent？You mean，like，insurance agent？Like…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.68,0:48:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like a good neighbor，Mater is there！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.28,0:48:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！You mean secret agents！You guys is spies！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.42,0:48:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,In how many makes and models did this type of engine appear？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.62,0:48:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was standard in seven models over a 12 year period.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.26,0:48:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,At least 35，000 cars were made with this engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.73,0:48:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're purty。- Yes，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.06,0:48:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And so nice。- Just pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.73,0:48:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,This seems like a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.64,0:48:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,If there was something in the photo that could narrow this down，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.46,0:48:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd be happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.51,0:48:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You might not be happy，but I bet this feller is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.38,0:48:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,See how he's had most of his parts replaced？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.78,0:48:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,And see all them boxes over there？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.75,0:48:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Them's all original parts。They ain't easy to come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.75,0:48:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Rare parts？- That's something we can track.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.85,0:48:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.52,0:49:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，Mater。I would never have seen that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.46,0:49:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know of a black market parts dealer in Paris，a treacherous lowlife，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.26,0:49:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,but he's the only car in the world who can tell us whose engine this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.93,0:49:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,What would you say to setting up an informal task force on this one？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.70,0:49:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。What？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.87,0:49:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You obviously have experience in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.14,0:49:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I live right next to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.94,0:49:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.61,0:49:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ain't exactly been much help to anybody recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.55,0:49:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're helping me。Please，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.28,0:49:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well… Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.99,0:49:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you know I'm just a tow truck，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.22,0:49:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。And I'm just in the import export business.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.69,0:49:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Siddeley？- Yes，Finn？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.39,0:49:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Paris。Tout de suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.96,0:49:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，two of them sweets for me，too，Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.63,0:49:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I always wanted to be a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.70,0:49:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？Me，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.40,0:49:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Afterburners，sir？- Is there any other way？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.02,0:50:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.14,0:50:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once we're inside，stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.17,0:50:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't bother checking VIN numbers。They're all dodgy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.57,0:50:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.94,0:50:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't talk to anyone，don't look at anyone，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.98,0:50:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,and absolutely，positively no idling。Are we clear？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.95,0:50:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。No idling。Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.65,0:50:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater？- Yeah，Finn？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.62,0:50:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We're not here to go shopping。- Shoppin'？What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.89,0:50:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why would I…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.86,0:50:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.46,0:50:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Part for sales，monsieur。- Monsieur，part for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.56,0:50:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,They got everything here。No！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.60,0:50:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at them hoods！I could use a hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.07,0:50:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，fellers。I gotta go！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.90,0:50:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。Whoa。He-he！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.31,0:50:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do what？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.31,0:51:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me。What are you selling？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.18,0:51:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Headlights，monsieur，headlights？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.01,0:51:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What in the？- Two for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.85,0:51:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I give you good price！- I'm good！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.32,0:51:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There you are。- There is some great bargains here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.66,0:51:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater，get back！- Imbile！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.90,0:51:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，wait for me！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.39,0:51:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhh！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.49,0:51:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ag-g-g-h！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.09,0:51:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Have you lost your mind？- But I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.43,0:51:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,This chap needs a tow。Hook him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.53,0:51:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.13,0:51:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You rusty piece of junk！Get your dirty hook off me！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.55,0:52:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Electroshock！Are you kidding me？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.58,0:52:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is her first field assignment。She didn't know you were my informant.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.52,0:52:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Informant？- A rookie，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.85,0:52:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never liked new car smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.46,0:52:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tomber was doing 20 to life in a Moroccan impound
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.39,0:52:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,the first time I saved him，if I recall correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.40,0:52:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Speaking of recalls，you're getting up there in mileage，aren't you？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.13,0:52:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，we get it。You both know each other，you're both old.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.27,0:52:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，here you go，informant。Inform us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.81,0:52:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Beuck！That is the worst motor ever made.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.48,0:52:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。That oil filter。Those wheel bearings.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.91,0:52:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do those parts look familiar，Tomber？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.08,0:52:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,They should。I sold them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.15,0:52:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- To whom？- No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.75,0:52:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's my best customer，but he always does his business over the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.56,0:52:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was always wondering why he needs so many parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.76,0:52:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.59,0:52:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,A lemon needs parts。Ain't nothin' truer than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.83,0:53:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lemon？- Yeah。Cars that don't ever work right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.97,0:53:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lemons is a tow truck's bread and butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.17,0:53:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like 'em Gremlins and Pacers we run into at the party
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.07,0:53:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the race and the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.74,0:53:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pull up the pictures from the oil platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.84,0:53:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to know what other type of cars were out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.34,0:53:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Let's see。There were Hugos and Trunkovs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.15,0:53:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are these cars considered lemons？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.98,0:53:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is the Popemobile Catholic？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.95,0:53:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone involved in this plot is one of history's biggest loser cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.02,0:53:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they're all taking their orders from the car behind this engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.56,0:53:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ah。This explains it。- What，Tomber？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.23,0:53:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gremlin，Pacer，Hugo and Trunkov
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.63,0:53:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,never get together，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.83,0:53:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,but they are having a secret meeting in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.50,0:53:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where's this meeting taking place？- Porto Corsa，Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.74,0:53:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's where the next race is！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.51,0:53:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a good chance our mystery engine will be there，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.31,0:53:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your chances are more than good.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.38,0:53:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just sent him a new clutch assembly yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.86,0:53:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,To Porto Corsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.58,0:53:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Contact Stevenson and have him meet us at Gare de Lyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.72,0:53:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.99,0:54:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,That three wheeled feller had to be right about a big meetin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.00,0:54:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You never see this many lemons in one town.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.10,0:54:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Less there's a swap meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.00,0:54:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,How'd you get all them pictures？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.87,0:54:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I reprogrammed Porto Corsa's red light cameras
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.55,0:54:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,to do recognition scans.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.11,0:54:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。Not only is you the purtiest car I ever met，
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.40,0:54:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you're the smartest，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.75,0:54:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you… I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.75,0:54:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a familiar sight。A Hugo being towed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.38,0:54:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he looks absolutely perfect！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.32,0:54:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course！They must be the heads of the lemon families.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.42,0:54:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Makes sense。If I was rich and broke down every day，
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.43,0:54:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd hire me to tow me around all the time，too！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.83,0:54:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got to infiltrate that meeting to find out who's behind all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.83,0:54:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hang on a minute。Hold still。- Ow！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.61,0:54:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah-ha。Good job，Miss Shiftwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.78,0:54:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Finn.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.11,0:54:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，I sure wish my friends could see me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.42,0:55:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,LUIGl：Guido，your eyes do not deceive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.92,0:55:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are in Italy。We are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.36,0:55:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Luigi。Which way to the hotel，man？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.36,0:55:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？No friend of mine will stay in a hotel in a my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.63,0:55:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will stay with my… Uncle Topolino-o-o-o！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.57,0:55:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luigi！Guido！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.61,0:55:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do they do it？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.58,0:55:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are the same ingredients as back home，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.66,0:55:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,but it tastes so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.99,0:55:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's organic，man。- Treehugger.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.83,0:55:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，race car.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.79,0:55:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You look so down，so low.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.83,0:55:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is like you have flat tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.27,0:55:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,She said you look like you are starving，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.14,0:55:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,that she's gonna make you a big meal and fatten you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.71,0:55:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.98,0:56:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mama Topolino，please，you don't need to make a fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.51,0:56:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Capisco。I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.31,0:56:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is a problem，yes，between you and a friend？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.52,0:56:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you know that？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.75,0:56:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,A wise car hears one word and understands two.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.49,0:56:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,That，and Luigi told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.13,0:56:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,While Mama cooks，come and take a stroll with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.89,0:56:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I brought my friend Mater along on the trip
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.33,0:56:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I told him he needed to act different，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.67,0:56:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,that we weren't in Radiator Springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.33,0:56:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,This Mater is a close friend？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.74,0:56:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.57,0:56:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then why would you ask him to be someone else？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.81,0:56:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did I do？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.51,0:56:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said some things during our fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.55,0:56:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，back when Guido and Luigi used to work for me，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.69,0:56:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,they would fight over everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.02,0:56:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,They fight over what Ferrari was the best Ferrari，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.63,0:56:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,which one of them looked more like a Ferrari.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.43,0:56:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,There were even some non Ferrari fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.80,0:57:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I tell them，「Va bene，it's OK to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.00,0:57:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Everybody fights now and then，especially best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.64,0:57:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,「But you got to make up fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.54,0:57:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「No fight more important than friendship。」
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.05,0:57:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What does that mean？- Whoever find a friend，find a treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.59,0:57:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，mangia。Eat！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.21,0:57:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finn，one hour to Porto Corsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.41,0:57:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Stevenson.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.24,0:57:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That should just about do it。- Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.65,0:57:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，Mater，it's voice activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.41,0:57:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,But everything's voice activated these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.28,0:57:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？I thought you was supposed to be makin' me a disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.69,0:57:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voice recognized。Disguise program initiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.06,0:57:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cool！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.26,0:57:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Computer，make me a German truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.43,0:58:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Request acknowledged。- Check it out！I'm wearing Materhosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.60,0:58:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make me a monster truck！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.80,0:58:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Request acknowledged。- What the？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.80,0:58:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I vant to siphon your gas！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.90,0:58:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now make me a taco truck！- Request acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.31,0:58:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A funny car！- Request acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.01,0:58:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,The idea is to keep a low profile，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.15,0:58:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I just go in，pretend to be this truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.52,0:58:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And leave the rest to us。- Now，hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.42,0:58:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to do the final fitting on your disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.43,0:58:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's no good。Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.43,0:58:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。What are you doin'？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.06,0:58:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The disguise won't calibrate effectively without a smooth surface to graft onto.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.04,0:58:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,For a second there，I thought you was tryin' to fix my dents.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.04,0:58:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，I was。- Then，no，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.51,0:58:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't get them dents buffed，pulled，filled or painted by nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.48,0:58:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They way too valuable。- Your dents are valuable？Really？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.98,0:59:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I come by each one of 'em with my best friend，Lightning McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.12,0:59:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't fix these。I wanna remember these dents forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.79,0:59:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，you were being serious in Paris？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.01,0:59:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen isn't just part of your cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.26,0:59:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Friendships can be dangerous in our line of work，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.33,0:59:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,But my line of work is towin' and salvage.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.47,0:59:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。And Miss Shiftwell's is designing iPhone apps.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.67,0:59:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，I meant for real。- It's OK。I'll work around the dent.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.11,0:59:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh… - In the meantime…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.41,0:59:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you look a little light on weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.96,0:59:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are looking live at beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.79,0:59:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Porto Corsa，Italy，on the Italian Riviera.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.23,0:59:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a magnificent setting for the second race of the World Grand Prix！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.46,0:59:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well Brent，they call this place the 「Gem of the Riviera，」
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.39,0:59:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,and it's easy to see why.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.13,0:59:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,With its secluded beaches and opulent casinos，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.93,0:59:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Porto Corsa truly is a playground for the wealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.87,0:59:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And everyone who's anyone is here today，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.94,1:00:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,from the ultra- rich and super- famous
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.07,1:00:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,to world leaders and important dignitaries.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.54,1:00:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You aren't kidding，David.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.41,1:00:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't do a three point turn without bumping into some celebrity.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.81,1:00:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome，everyone，to the second race of the World Grand Prix，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.31,1:00:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,where the big news continues to be allinol.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.88,1:00:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir Miles Axlerod spoke to the press earlier today
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.82,1:00:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,to answer questions about its safety.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.12,1:00:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,An independent panel of scientists has determined
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.93,1:00:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,that allinol is completely safe，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.06,1:00:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Safe。There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.70,1:00:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,So the race will go on，folks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.43,1:00:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,But the question everyone is asking：
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.27,1:00:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will the real Lightning McQueen show up today？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.04,1:00:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'd better。Talk about a home track advantage.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.14,1:00:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Francesco Bernoulli grew up racing on this course.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.14,1:00:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Signore e signori，in the pole position，Numero Uno，Francesco！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.11,1:00:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bellissima！Thank you for your support！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.35,1:00:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,And your big mistake，McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.95,1:00:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,In secondo position，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.45,1:00:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,numero 95，Lightning-a McQueen-a！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.49,1:01:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen-a，is a everything OK？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.26,1:01:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're worried about your fuel，man，don't。It's perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.83,1:01:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，guys，I just really wish Mater were here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.77,1:01:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Francesco understands，McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.80,1:01:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，great，here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.87,1:01:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you got，Francesco？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.91,1:01:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,For famous race cars like Francesco and，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.46,1:01:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,well，you，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.31,1:01:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,to be far away from home is not easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.35,1:01:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you forgot the insulting part of that insult.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.58,1:01:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is a no insult.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.22,1:01:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,When a Francesco is away from home，he misses his mama，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.29,1:01:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,just like a you miss your tow truck amico.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.19,1:01:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gee，I maybe misjudged you，because that's exactly…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.33,1:01:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course，I am at home，and my mama is right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.60,1:01:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mama！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.56,1:01:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry，Mama，McQueen is very sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.77,1:01:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will beat his cry baby bottom today！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.24,1:01:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,And there's the insult we were missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.46,1:02:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Darrell，the racers are settling in as they head
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.99,1:02:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,to the Italian countryside.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.39,1:02:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo，boy！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.43,1:02:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is gonna be a great race.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.24,1:02:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gremlins。Man，those are some ugly cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.28,1:02:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look like someone stole their trunks.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.25,1:02:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,My grand a father has a broken down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.66,1:02:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,If a one of a you would help，I would be so thankful.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.59,1:02:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds like you need some roadside assistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.70,1:02:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She was talking to me。- Really？Prove it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.03,1:02:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't a fight over me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.07,1:02:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Signore Tow Truck，per favore.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.04,1:02:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get ready，Mater。You're on any moment now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.44,1:03:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know about this。What if I screw things up？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.28,1:03:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.91,1:03:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just apply the same level of dedication
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.05,1:03:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,you've been using to play the idiot tow truck，and you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.62,1:03:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just that them guys look purty tough and…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.11,1:03:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，did you say 「idiot」？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.02,1:03:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is that how you see me？- That's how everyone sees you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.13,1:03:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't that the idea？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.66,1:03:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I tell you，that's the genius of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.70,1:03:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one realizes they're being fooled
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.87,1:03:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,because they're too busy laughing at the fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.54,1:03:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brilliant！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.14,1:03:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why aren't you in disguise？- I er…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.34,1:03:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on！There's no time！Go！- OK。OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.65,1:03:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Computer，disguise！- Request acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.62,1:03:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the boss。He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.30,1:03:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ivan.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.33,1:03:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，er…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.07,1:04:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ivan，why do you insult me so by making me wait here？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.95,1:04:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's in.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.88,1:04:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,The racers are now making their way around the hairpin
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.65,1:04:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,and headed downhill toward the casino bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.77,1:04:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,No more bets，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.47,1:04:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，fuzzy dice！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.11,1:04:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Number four。Easy four。- Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.14,1:04:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Air freshener。Antenna balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.18,1:04:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spark a plugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.08,1:04:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,This place looks like it's made outta gold！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.55,1:04:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's because it is。Now，be careful what you say.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.95,1:04:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.99,1:04:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean，「Don't talk to ya」？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.02,1:04:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want me to stop talkin' to ya right now？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.53,1:04:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are acting strange today，Ivan.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.29,1:05:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're talking about，
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.23,1:05:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Alexander Hugo，aka Chop Shop Alex。」
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.57,1:05:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a lot of aka's，Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.60,1:05:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,But that makes sense，
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.68,1:05:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,seein's how you's wanted in France，Germany…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.74,1:05:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，stop it！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.78,1:05:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，OK，keep your voice down！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.21,1:05:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gonna make me arrested！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.25,1:05:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't mess with Ivan today。He's in a bad mood.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.85,1:05:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's so good！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.12,1:05:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Victor！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.49,1:05:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Victor！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.86,1:05:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There you are！- Come in！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.42,1:05:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Victor Hugo，I'm J Curby Gremlin。From Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.66,1:05:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.53,1:05:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is the big boss here yet？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.47,1:05:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，not yet。- He's supposed to be here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.47,1:05:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.78,1:05:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guten Tag.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.24,1:05:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just the professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.35,1:05:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Zedapp！When is he coming？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.05,1:05:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's already here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.99,1:06:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome，everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.45,1:06:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wish I could be with you on this very special day，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.79,1:06:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,but my clutch assembly broke.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.89,1:06:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You know how it is。- Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.09,1:06:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,We know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.83,1:06:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Descramble that voice。- I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.10,1:06:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it's too sophisticated.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.30,1:06:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are here to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.84,1:06:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today，all your hard work pays off.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.91,1:06:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The world turned their backs on cars like us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.71,1:06:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,They stopped manufacturing us，stopped making our parts.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.25,1:06:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only thing they haven't stopped doing is laughing at us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.45,1:06:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,They've called us terrible names：Jalopy，rust bucket，heap，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.32,1:06:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,clunker，junker，beater，wreck，rattletrap，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.39,1:06:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,lemon.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.80,1:06:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,But their insults just give us strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.43,1:06:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because today，my friends，that all ends！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.61,1:06:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's smoke on the casino bridge！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.81,1:06:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.91,1:06:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Carla Veloso，the Brazilian race car！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.52,1:07:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What just happened？- I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.55,1:07:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,They laughed at us，but now it's our turn to laugh back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.49,1:07:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another crash！It's number 9，Nigel Gearsley.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.16,1:07:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Embrace your inner lemon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.96,1:07:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let it drive you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.70,1:07:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm detecting an extremely strong electromagnetic pulse.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.07,1:07:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Finn，it's the camera。- Where？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.07,1:07:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,On the tower！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.24,1:07:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,This was meant to be alternative fuel's greatest moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.38,1:07:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,But after today，everyone will race back to gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.32,1:07:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we，the owners of the world's largest untapped oil reserve
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.39,1:07:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,will become the most powerful cars in the world！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.13,1:07:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out of the way！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.86,1:08:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,They will come to us，and they will have no choice，because they will need us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.24,1:08:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh？Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.44,1:08:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,We figured you might stop by！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.18,1:08:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they will finally respect us！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.92,1:08:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,So hold your hoods high！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.22,1:08:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,After today，you will never again be ashamed of who you are！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.66,1:08:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.54,1:08:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.46,1:08:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Long live lemons！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.43,1:09:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Number 7 is loose！Shu Todoroki！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.75,1:09:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finn？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.86,1:09:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bumper to bumper as they approach the finish line！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.56,1:09:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen's the winner！Francesco's second！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.56,1:09:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,They have no idea what happened behind them.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.10,1:09:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is impossible！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.66,1:09:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about！Ka-chow！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.67,1:09:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.57,1:09:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are all the other cars？- What is going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.10,1:09:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.25,1:09:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir Axlerod，is the final race in London still going to take place？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.98,1:09:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suppose that…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.02,1:09:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,The show must go on，as they say.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.39,1:10:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is really happening！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.52,1:10:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quiet！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.72,1:10:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you require all the racers to still run on allinol？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.89,1:10:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I cannot，in good conscience，continue to risk the lives of any more race cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.33,1:10:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,The final race will not be run on allinol.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.24,1:10:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you have it，
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.12,1:10:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,a clearly devastated Sir Miles Axlerod
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.01,1:10:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,announcing that he will not require the cars to use allinol for the final race.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.28,1:10:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,A toast！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.68,1:10:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,To the death of allinol and alternative fuel forever！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.45,1:10:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，abort the mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.42,1:10:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,They've got Finn。Get out of there。Get out of there right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.56,1:10:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,How is your grandfather？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.36,1:10:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Long live lemons！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.43,1:10:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't this a great party，Ivan，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.86,1:10:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah，it's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.73,1:10:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are not leaving，are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.90,1:10:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh… of course I ain't leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.93,1:10:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- McQUEEN ON TV：I'm just in shock… - McQueen？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.83,1:10:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- McQUEEN ON TV：I'm just in shock… - McQueen？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.54,1:10:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crashes are a part of racing，I know，
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.57,1:10:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,but something like that should never happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.87,1:10:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can choose your fuel for the final race。What it'll be？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.48,1:10:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Allinol.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.08,1:11:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,After today？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.45,1:11:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,My friend Fillmore says it's safe。That's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.48,1:11:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't stand by a friend of mine recently.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.95,1:11:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna make the same mistake twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.29,1:11:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,So a surprising revelation from Lightning McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.32,1:11:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,He will use allinol in the final race，despite what occurred today.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.06,1:11:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …till Lightning McQueen is dead。- Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.77,1:11:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Allinol must be finished for good.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.60,1:11:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen cannot win the last race.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.74,1:11:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightning McQueen must be killed！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.11,1:11:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.48,1:11:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the American spy！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.82,1:11:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad gum！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.02,1:11:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gatling gun。Request acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.19,1:11:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down！Everybody，down！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.22,1:11:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shoot！I didn't mean… Request acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.14,1:12:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！Wait！I didn't mean that kind of shoot！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.61,1:12:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Correction acknowledged。Deploying chute.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.81,1:12:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.38,1:12:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.99,1:12:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！What's this？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.42,1:12:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.73,1:12:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen！McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.53,1:12:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Waagh！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.07,1:12:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me through！Let me through！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.04,1:12:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me in！I got to get through to warn McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.51,1:12:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You cannot a come through here！Back up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.61,1:12:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a lunatic at gate 9.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.11,1:12:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was disguised as a tow truck to infiltrate this lemonhead meeting
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.02,1:12:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,and my weapons system's done misinterperated what I'm saying！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.12,1:12:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lunatic at gate 9。- McQueen！McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.89,1:12:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You are the champion！- This way，signore.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.16,1:12:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- McQueen！- Mater？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.23,1:12:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- McQueen。- Give us a pose！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.73,1:13:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- McQueen！- Stop moving。Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.13,1:13:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where you going？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.31,1:13:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where you going？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.53,1:13:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.77,1:13:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- McQueen！- That really sounded like…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.27,1:13:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.54,1:13:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater？- Signore？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.17,1:13:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen！They're gonna kill you！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.34,1:13:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.84,1:13:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.24,1:13:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.11,1:13:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scusi。Mater！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.95,1:13:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- McQueen！- Scusi.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.65,1:13:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater！Mater！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.15,1:13:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，I'm so glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.19,1:13:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightning McQueen！I am a huge fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.36,1:13:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，I thought I heard…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.09,1:13:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.73,1:13:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said，「You killed out there today。You're the best。」
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.16,1:13:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？I mean，thanks。- Right this way，signore.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.00,1:13:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really thought I heard my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.80,1:13:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,In England，you'll be finished！At the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.21,1:13:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wait，what？- The press is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.58,1:13:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come a with me，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.32,1:13:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me go！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.75,1:13:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You actually care about that race car.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.35,1:13:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,A pity you didn't warn him in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.16,1:14:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Idiot」？Is that how you see me？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.16,1:14:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's how everyone sees you。I tell you，that's the genius of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.33,1:14:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one realizes they're being fooled
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.44,1:14:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,because they're too busy laughing at the fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.31,1:14:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,At the fool…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.78,1:14:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.71,1:14:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Domo arigato！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.68,1:14:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.38,1:14:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.38,1:14:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You done good。You got all the leaves.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.32,1:14:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Check out that tow truck。- I wonder who that guy's with.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.92,1:14:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you guys excuse me just for one little second？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.32,1:14:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now that's a scoop of ice cream！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.96,1:14:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aargh！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.16,1:14:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody get me water！Oh，sweet relief.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.53,1:14:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.77,1:14:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I never leak oil。Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.71,1:14:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get a hold of yourself。You're making a scene！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.41,1:14:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute。I didn't screw you up，did I？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.75,1:15:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I lost the race because of you！- Maybe if I talked to somebody…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.08,1:15:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't need your help！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.85,1:15:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.88,1:15:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your help…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.49,1:15:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bang the gong。Get it on！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.56,1:15:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，this isn't Radiator Springs.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.76,1:15:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is exactly why I don't bring you along to these things！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.01,1:15:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holley！Finn！Where are we？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.78,1:15:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're in London，Mater，inside Big Bentley.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.65,1:15:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.65,1:15:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.06,1:15:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，this… This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.00,1:15:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.13,1:15:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I am，remember？You said so.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.20,1:15:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,When did I… Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.24,1:16:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，I was complimenting you on what a good spy you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.31,1:16:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not a spy！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.25,1:16:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been trying to tell you that the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.81,1:16:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really am just a tow truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.02,1:16:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finn，he's not joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.95,1:16:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I know。- You were right，Finn。I'm a fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.92,1:16:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what's happened to McQueen is 'cause I'm such a big one.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.06,1:16:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.17,1:16:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good。You're up。- And just in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.03,1:16:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Z wanted you to have a front row seat，
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.87,1:16:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's still alive？- Not for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.41,1:16:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.88,1:16:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.85,1:16:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We came as soon as you called。- I called to talk to Mater.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.89,1:16:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,It never occurred to me he wouldn't be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.19,1:16:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sheriff is talking to Scotland Yard now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.39,1:17:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Sarge is in touch with his friends in the British military.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.50,1:17:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just need to focus on the race.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.27,1:17:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know but，Sally
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.27,1:17:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,with everything going on，I'm not sure…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.07,1:17:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sir Axlerod。- I'm sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.51,1:17:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's all right。- I just wanted to personally thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.74,1:17:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because after Italy，I was finished，
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.53,1:17:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,and then you gave me one last shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.78,1:17:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.88,1:17:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I probably shouldn't be saying this，but I hope you win today.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.35,1:17:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You show the world that they've been wrong about allinol.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.36,1:17:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater would want you to race.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.52,1:17:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。For Mater.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.79,1:18:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.35,1:18:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What happened？- I don't know，Professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.65,1:18:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What did you do？- I didn't do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.95,1:18:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ssh，I'm talking to the Professor。What's that，Professor？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.19,1:18:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You broke it！- Quiet！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.79,1:18:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I understand，sir。Yes。- What did he say？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.26,1:18:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We go to the back up plan。- Back up plan？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.26,1:18:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,We snuck a bomb in McQueen's pit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.60,1:18:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,The next time he makes a stop，instead of saying 「ka chow」…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.07,1:18:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,he's going to go 「ka boom」！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.97,1:18:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't feel bad，tow truck。You couldn't have saved him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.57,1:18:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，wait，you could have！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.84,1:18:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad gum lemons！Request acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.98,1:19:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？You didn't think we'd take your bullets？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.72,1:19:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right！You got nothing！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.89,1:19:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's the lemon now，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.79,1:19:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice try，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.20,1:19:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad gum… Dad gum… Dad gum。- Request… Request… Request…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.40,1:19:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.07,1:19:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got to get y'all out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.91,1:19:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no time。McQueen needs your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.41,1:19:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I can't。I'm just a tow truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.81,1:19:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's up to you。Go to the pits and get everyone out.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.32,1:19:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You can do that。- What about you guys？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.92,1:19:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We'll be OK。- Go and get some more dents，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.06,1:19:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，we'll be OK？Really？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.10,1:19:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wouldn't have left if I'd told him the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.77,1:19:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Argh！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.27,1:19:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Being killed by a clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.94,1:19:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gives a whole new meaning to 「Your time has come。」
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.78,1:20:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time？That's it！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.92,1:20:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doing？- Trying to turn back time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.09,1:20:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I can just reverse the polarity.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.80,1:20:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good job。Quick thinking，Holley.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.81,1:20:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's everybody on the wrong side of the road for？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.71,1:20:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.55,1:20:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drive！Burn rubber！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.29,1:20:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got to get to the course.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.99,1:20:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calculate the fastest way to…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.63,1:20:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.76,1:20:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。Miss Shiftwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.57,1:21:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're standard issue now。- You kids get all the good hardware.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.24,1:21:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，that's Mater's.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.17,1:21:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，that's Mater's.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.92,1:21:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come back here！Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.06,1:21:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater？- Everybody，get out now！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.40,1:21:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater？- Everybody，get out now！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.79,1:21:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Y'all get out of the pits。What are you guys doing here？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.83,1:21:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We're here because of you，Mater。- Is everything OK？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.19,1:21:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，everything's not OK。There's a bomb in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.93,1:21:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Y'all got to get out。Now。- A bomb？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.47,1:21:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater。- Finn！You're OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.64,1:21:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me。The bomb is on you！They knew you'd try to help McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.60,1:21:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,When we were knocked out，they planted it in your air filter.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.41,1:21:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Uh-oh。- Mater！There you are！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.15,1:21:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stop right there！- I've been so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.05,1:21:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't come any closer！- Are you OK？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.82,1:21:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm not OK！Stay away from me！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.59,1:21:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，wait！Wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.16,1:22:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,A tow truck has just raced onto the track，driving backwards！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.66,1:22:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.13,1:22:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Normally an emergency vehicle on the track means there's been an accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.07,1:22:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lightning McQueen is chasing him！- Mater，wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.83,1:22:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay back！If you get close to me，you're going to get hurt real bad！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.77,1:22:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know I made you feel that way before，but none of that matters！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.71,1:22:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're best friends！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.21,1:22:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,And McQueen seems to be having
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.98,1:22:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,a conversation with the tow truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.88,1:22:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know who that truck is，Brent，but tell you what，
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.69,1:22:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,he's got to be the world's best backwards driver.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.99,1:22:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen，you don't get it！I'm the bomb！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.06,1:22:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Mater！You are the bomb！That's what I'm trying to say here！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.70,1:22:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've always been the bomb and you'll always be the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.27,1:22:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stay away！- No！Never！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.00,1:22:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.67,1:22:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you get away again！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.24,1:22:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got to keep away from McQueen！Request acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.55,1:23:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.46,1:23:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is happening？It's a bad dream！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.96,1:23:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Lightning McQueen just blasted away，
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.53,1:23:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,hooked to the now rocket propelled tow truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.14,1:23:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gargh！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.71,1:23:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Professor's on the run！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.35,1:23:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Someone's got to get McQueen。- Get McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.35,1:23:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Holley，I'll get Zedapp。Help Mater。- Got it！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.86,1:23:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is happening？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.91,1:24:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry，Professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.09,1:24:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You really think I'm going to let you float away，Professor？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.45,1:24:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- McQueen，let go！- Never！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.86,1:24:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're coming your way。- Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.13,1:25:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give it up，McMissile.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.85,1:25:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater，stop！- No way！You could get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.26,1:25:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.88,1:25:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，we've got to get that bomb off you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.75,1:25:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bomb？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.82,1:25:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，they strapped it to me to kill you as a back up plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.89,1:26:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back up plan？Mater，who put a bomb on you？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.72,1:26:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You！Why didn't my death ray kill you？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.29,1:26:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Death ray？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.70,1:26:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn off the bomb，Zedapp！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.10,1:26:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all so dense？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.50,1:26:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's voice activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.50,1:26:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deactivate！Deactivate！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.10,1:26:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deactivate！Deactivate！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.34,1:26:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voice denied.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.74,1:26:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Huh！- Oops.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.41,1:26:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did I forget to mention that it can only be disarmed
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.94,1:26:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,by the one who activated it？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.98,1:26:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Say it。- Deactivate.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.88,1:26:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voice denied.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.29,1:26:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not the one who activated it。Would anyone else like to try？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.76,1:26:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You read my mind。- He was getting on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.16,1:26:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do we do？- It's very simple。You blow up.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.13,1:26:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going out on a limb here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.37,1:26:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are the guys that want me dead，correct？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.97,1:26:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's nothing personal。- Fellers，listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.54,1:26:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know what you're going through.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.61,1:26:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody's been laughing at me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.74,1:26:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,But becoming powerful and rich beyond your wildest dreams
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.98,1:26:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,ain't gonna make you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.28,1:27:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but it's worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.59,1:27:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pit stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.00,1:27:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not today，boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.61,1:27:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Retreat！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.25,1:27:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help，Corporal.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.15,1:27:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything for one of Pop's mates.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.82,1:27:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's he saying？What's wrong？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.89,1:27:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,None of his wrenches fit the bolts.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.20,1:27:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I get it。I get it！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.23,1:27:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I know what needs to be done。- Then do it！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.64,1:27:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？No。I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.90,1:27:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody takes me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.94,1:28:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know that now.This ain't Radiator Springs.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.54,1:28:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.11,1:28:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，you're yourself in Radiator Springs.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.31,1:28:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be yourself here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.85,1:28:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if people aren't taking you seriously，
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.12,1:28:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,then they need to change，not you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.22,1:28:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know that because I was wrong before.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.39,1:28:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，you can do this。You're the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.56,1:28:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.56,1:28:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you're the actual bomb。Now，let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.53,1:28:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，right。Hang on！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.53,1:28:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's he going？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.17,1:28:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Computer！- Yes，Agent Mater？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.21,1:28:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need that thing you done before to get me away from McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.18,1:28:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Request acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.95,1:28:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater？- Now I need you to do the chute！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.22,1:28:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,The second kind，not the first！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.25,1:28:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deploying chute
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.14,1:29:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's winning the race？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.78,1:29:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Back off！Back away！- It's Lightning McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.32,1:29:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's OK！Tell 'em，Mater。Explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.62,1:29:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.72,1:29:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody's been sabotaging the racers and hurtin' the cars，and I know who.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.59,1:29:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，wait。Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.03,1:29:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bomb！It's a bomb！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.73,1:29:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Everybody，down！- Back up！Move it！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.44,1:29:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get off the stage！Move it！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.47,1:29:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold your fire！He can't disarm it！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.61,1:29:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，I don't know what you're doing，but stand down now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.04,1:29:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,This ain't nothing at all like Radiator Springs.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.88,1:29:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，just cut to the chase.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.92,1:29:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。It's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.95,1:29:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Me？You've got to be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.09,1:29:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I figured it out when I realized y'all attached
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.12,1:29:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,this ticking time bomb with Whitworth bolts
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.69,1:30:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,the same bolts that hold together that old British engine from the photograph.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.83,1:30:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Holley！Show that picture。- OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.13,1:30:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I remembered what they say about old British engines：
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.87,1:30:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,If there ain't no oil under 'em，there ain't no oil in 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.04,1:30:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is he talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.67,1:30:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was you leaking oil at the party in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.31,1:30:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just blamed it on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.08,1:30:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Electric cars don't use oil，you twit.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.71,1:30:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then you're fakin' it。You didn't convert to no electric.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.12,1:30:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we pop that hood，we'll see that engine from that picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.35,1:30:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,This lorry's crazy！He's going to kill us all！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.56,1:30:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay away！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.79,1:30:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Sir Axlerod created the race.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.05,1:30:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why would he want to hurt anyone？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.76,1:30:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,To make allinol look bad
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.58,1:30:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,so everybody'd go back to using oil.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.67,1:30:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,He said it himself with that disguised voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.30,1:30:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Disguised voice？What are you talking about？You're nuts，you are！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.34,1:30:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is going nowhere fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.07,1:30:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,We really should go，Grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.24,1:30:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,One moment，I'd like to see where this is going.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.71,1:30:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，he created allinol.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.68,1:30:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what if he found that huge oil field
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.48,1:30:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,just as the world was trying to find something else？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.09,1:31:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if he came up with allinol
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.45,1:31:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,just to make alternative fuel look bad？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.99,1:31:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,「What if」？You're basing this on a 「what if」？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.13,1:31:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，that's it。- Lads，clear out.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.13,1:31:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！Somebody save me！The lorry's crazy！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.33,1:31:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Keep away，you idiot！- Mater！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.00,1:31:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mater！- Someone do something！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.17,1:31:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're insane，you are！Deactivate！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.42,1:31:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're insane，you are！Deactivate！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.31,1:31:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bomb deactivated。Have a nice day，Sir Axlerod.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.19,1:31:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The engine from the photo。- It's a perfect match.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.16,1:31:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did the tow truck figure it out？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.76,1:31:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's official。You're coming to all my races from now on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.16,1:31:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you're talkin'！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.54,1:31:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，let's go。You're on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.25,1:32:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your Majesty，may I present
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.61,1:32:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,for the investiture of honorary knighthood of the British Realm…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.75,1:32:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tow Mater of Radiator Springs.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.26,1:32:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go get 'em，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.90,1:32:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hereby dub thee Sir Tow Mater.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.27,1:32:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir？Shoot，you can just call me Mater，Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.94,1:32:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear none of this 「sir」 business.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.51,1:32:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,By the way，have y'all met each other？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.11,1:32:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Queen，McQueen。McQueen，Queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.98,1:32:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen，McMissile。McMissile，McQueen。Queen，McMissile.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.85,1:32:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,So there we was，my rocket jets going full blast，
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.96,1:32:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen hanging on for dear life
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.03,1:32:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,when suddenly them two nasty lemons come out of nowheres，guns drawed.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.10,1:32:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,We was goners.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.90,1:33:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,But then，out of nowhere this beautiful spy car
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.17,1:33:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,swoops in from the sky to save us！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.27,1:33:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a very entertaining story，young man.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.31,1:33:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Minny，please。Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.34,1:33:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,None of this happened。Rocket jets，flying spy cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.28,1:33:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you're quite right。It does sound a bit far fetched.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.88,1:33:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holley！What are you doin' here？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.78,1:33:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Mater！It's so good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.79,1:33:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finn！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.85,1:33:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our satellites picked up an urgent communiqu？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.12,1:33:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you got a my email.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.93,1:33:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Y'all is going to have a great time！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.46,1:33:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody，this here's Finn McMissile。He's a secret agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.40,1:33:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't tell nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.67,1:33:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,And this is Holley Shiftwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.74,1:33:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's… - I'm Mater's girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.80,1:33:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's so nice to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.87,1:33:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guido believe you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.18,1:33:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，honey。You got a nasty dent there.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.88,1:33:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- Was that from when you swooped in
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.78,1:33:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you saved them in London？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.72,1:33:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Van！- What？I'm just asking！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.78,1:33:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you worry。My baby Ramone can get that fixed up for you in no time.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.56,1:33:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，sure thing。No problemo。Let me go get my tools.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.73,1:34:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no。I'm keeping that dent。It's way too valuable.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.76,1:34:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,A valuable dent？She's as crazy as Mater.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.03,1:34:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those two are perfect for each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.94,1:34:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's one thing I still don't get.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.54,1:34:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,The bad guys hit me with the beam from the camera，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.44,1:34:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So，why didn't I… - Explode in a fiery inferno？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.21,1:34:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- We couldn't figure that out，either.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.41,1:34:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our investigation proved that allinol was actually gasoline
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.55,1:34:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,and Axlerod engineered it so when it got hit by the beam，
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.11,1:34:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,it would explode.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.95,1:34:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a second，Fillmore。You said my fuel was safe！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.53,1:34:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're implying that I switched that rot gut excuse for alternative fuel
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.73,1:34:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,with my all natural，sustainable，organic biofuel
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.67,1:34:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,just because I never trusted Axlerod，
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.94,1:34:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,you're dead wrong，man！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.14,1:34:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was him！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.28,1:34:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once big oil，always big oil，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.41,1:34:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tree hugger.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.75,1:34:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Radiator Springs Grand Prix is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.39,1:35:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,All spectators，clear the starting line.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.56,1:35:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get rockin'。This is gonna be wicked！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.16,1:35:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We should do this every year.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.86,1:35:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I just figured we never found out who the world's fastest car is.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.07,1:35:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Plus，no press，no trophy，just racing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.70,1:35:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The way I like it。- Francesco likes it like this，too.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.41,1:35:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Francesco，I'd like you to meet… - Signorina Sally.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.08,1:35:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is official.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.51,1:35:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightning McQueen is the luckiest car in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.18,1:35:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.38,1:35:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which he will have to be to have a chance against Francesco today！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.59,1:35:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you at the finish line，Mc… What is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.59,1:35:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is- a good，McQueen。Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.66,1:35:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was- a funnier when I did it，but it's- a very funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.60,1:35:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you going to do next？Are you going to take off your fenders？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.90,1:35:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try it。You'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.70,1:35:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，he's not so good looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.00,1:35:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。Nice try。- I'm serious！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.44,1:35:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why I love you，Sally.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.74,1:35:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wish me luck！- You don't need it！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.64,1:36:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ooh- hm！That Francesco is fine- looking！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.55,1:36:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,And those open wheels.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.22,1:36:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ooh，I'm gonna have to go get myself some coolant.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.63,1:36:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，Lightning！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.32,1:36:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go，Stickers！- Right on，man！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.09,1:36:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go get 'em，tiger！- Bravo，bravo！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.12,1:36:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go，Lightning，go！- Go，McQueen！Whoo-hoo！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.56,1:36:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finn？Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.09,1:36:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Siddeley's gassed，geared and ready to fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.20,1:36:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're leavin' already？- We've got another mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.47,1:36:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stopped by here to pick something up.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.90,1:37:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somethin' tells me you're not talkin' about souvenir bumper stickers.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.71,1:37:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her Majesty asked for you personally，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.14,1:37:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But I told y'all before，I'm not a spy。- We know.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.58,1:37:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spy or not，
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.71,1:37:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,you're still the smartest，most honest chap we've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.38,1:37:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't forget massively charming。- Well，thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.82,1:37:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,But as much fun as it was hangin' with y'all，this…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.02,1:37:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is home.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.79,1:37:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's all right。We understand。But I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.76,1:37:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,You still owe me that first date.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.73,1:37:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,If there's ever anything I can do for you，just let me know.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.80,1:37:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I sure appreciate that。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.37,1:37:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，there is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.64,1:37:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo-hoo！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.04,1:37:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo！I'll be doggone！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.78,1:37:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，whoa，whoa！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.26,1:37:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Mater！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.26,1:37:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha！Whoo！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.00,1:38:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Impossible！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.40,1:38:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ha-ha！- Mater！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.97,1:38:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check it out。They let me keep the rockets.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.64,1:38:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll see you at the finish line，buddy！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.84,1:38:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not if I see you first！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.88,1:38:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yippee！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是探员利兰·超动力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急呼叫探员芬恩·麦导弹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩，我的身份已经暴露，局面已失控
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.93,0:00:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜我在这儿发现了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从来没见过这么大的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.17,0:01:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至没人知道有这种东西存在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩，我需要支援
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过别联络装甲部队，会把行动搞砸的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.51,0:01:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要小心，这里现在不安全
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就把我的方位传送给你，祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:28.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《赛车总动员2》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，兄弟，我们到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.35,0:01:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你雇我带你来的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你来这儿干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找一辆车
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:01:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆车？哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:02:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，伙计，这是离陆地最远的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我要来的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.13,0:02:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你吧，这地方除了咱俩就没别人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能干什么，老大？我是捕蟹船耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就调头，从哪儿来回哪儿去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.38,0:02:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭什么，我看谁敢赶我？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.55,0:02:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了，行了，把你的新式武器收起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.19,0:02:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真过分！抱歉朋友，看来这就是终点站了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.19,0:02:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知：所有工人上码头报到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩·麦导弹呼叫利兰·超动力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已到达集结地点，完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，伙计们，你们知道规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩呼叫利兰，请回答，完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.67,0:03:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊，各位，箱子可不会自己卸自己
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,车太多了，都给我让开
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,泽达普教授？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个，教授，在装船之前你要看看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，是的，千万小心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，摄像机
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它是用来做什么的？- 这个摄像机非常非常危险
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在忙活什么呢，教授？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.47,0:04:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是贵重设备，在途中一定要小心保护
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 嗨，Z教授！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我跟你说过的英国间谍之一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈！我们抓住他时，他正呆在不该他去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员利兰·超动力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是芬恩·麦导弹！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看到了摄像机，干掉他！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体就位！全体就位！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊啊啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.78,0:06:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,上快艇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:07:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他逃脱了！- 逃不掉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决他了，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,妙极了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩·麦导弹一死，谁还妨碍得了我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，拖车脱线，时刻为您服务
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿，奥的斯！- 嘿，脱线
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.51,0:07:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…老天，真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.05,0:07:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为这次能行呢，可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么流畅啊，是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉，我这是骗谁呢？我一直都是辆柠檬车
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真够呛，你又漏油了，肯定是垫圈的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，不过从好的一面来说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你本月第十次拖车服务，所以免费哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，只有你对我这种破车这么好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.57,0:08:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别灰心，哇塞，每辆车都会出状况的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可你就从不漏油 - 那倒是，不过我也不是十全十美的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.41,0:08:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可别告诉别人，我觉得我锈得越来越明显了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，闪电麦坤回来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他赢了第四座活塞杯，一定开心坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四座！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.09,0:08:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我们都为他骄傲死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我希望他赶快回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.86,0:08:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为最好的朋友要在一起欢度整个夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我和…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇，哇，哇！- 麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线！我不赶时间！- 嘿，大伙儿，麦坤回来啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:08:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊啊！- 麦坤回来啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.11,0:09:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦坤回来啦！麦坤回来啦！- 啊！哦哦！哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.18,0:09:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤回来啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，闪电！欢迎回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.62,0:09:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你回来真是太好了，宝贝！- 祝贺你，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.25,0:09:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家，战士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方没你就是不一样，孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？他到别处去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好，回家真好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线！- 麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.93,0:09:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线！- 麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.30,0:09:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.41,0:09:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，奥的斯，这次你走了多远？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到边境线还有一半路程 - 哦，还不错嘛，伙计！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.85,0:09:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是！我也不相信呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.51,0:09:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦坤！欢迎你回来！- 脱线，见到你真好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是，哥们儿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟，你肯定猜不到我有什么好点子！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这哥俩见面真是一年比一年亲热！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.83,0:09:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想不想试试真正好玩的？- 我有东西要先给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.43,0:09:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.73,0:10:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,真难以置信，活塞杯上有新名字了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.23,0:10:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字就在哈德森医生的下面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道医生说这些不过是些旧杯子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.94,0:10:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但被其他人赢走了感觉还是不好，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生真的为你感到骄傲，我能肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，哥们儿，我整个夏天就在等这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有什么好点子？- 嗬嗬！你确定自己能搞得定？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧你说的，我可是闪电麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么是我搞不定的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…脱线？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住，刹车在这上没用！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.57,0:10:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线？- 放轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.57,0:10:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些铁轨好多年没用过了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊啊！- 快点，再快点，加油，来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，哇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.59,0:10:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，我不确定，你觉得呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得会很好玩的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.81,0:11:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢哦，这就不好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.61,0:11:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈！今天过得最开心了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.71,0:11:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还留了个新凹痕，我最喜欢的纪念
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.15,0:11:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天，脱线，今天真是… - 哇塞，这不算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.86,0:11:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上等着看我的新点子吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，脱线，喔！我只想安安静静吃顿晚饭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.60,0:11:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是，我指莎莉，脱线 - 那更好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你，我和莎莉小姐，出去吃晚饭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，我是说就我和莎莉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.18,0:11:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 你明白的，就今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦… - 明天你想玩什么都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.45,0:11:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.75,0:11:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 理解万岁 - 是啊，当然
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.25,0:12:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你们玩得开心点 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.47,0:12:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，这里可真美
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.63,0:12:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总算能独自呆着，感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.61,0:12:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和我 - 嗯哼！晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦！- 我叫脱线
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们的服务生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线服务生，真好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线？你在这儿上班？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，我在这儿上班，不然你以为呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我趁人不备偷偷溜进来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.39,0:12:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,假扮成你们的服务生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了跟你们一起玩？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，也是，那多可笑呀是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.99,0:12:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个小情侣要点饮料吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的，我就喝平常喝的 - 这样好不好？我也要那个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…对，你常喝的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢，伙计 - 谢谢，圭多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,圭多，麦坤常喝的是什么饮料？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.65,0:13:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好极了，来两杯 - 安静！我的节目开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.75,0:13:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,今夜，来到梅尔·多拉真人秀的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.12,0:13:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的故事全球瞩目
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.03,0:13:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,石油大亨，亿万富翁麦尔斯·艾克斯勒洛德
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,力图成为不使用GPS进行环球航行的第一车
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,讽刺的是，他耗尽燃油，身陷荒野
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,36天后从死亡边缘生还
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,依靠他从自然界中提取的燃料发动了自己
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.47,0:13:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,此后，他就卖掉了石油公司
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己从油老虎摇身一变为电动车
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,并献身于寻找可再生清洁燃料的事业
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今他宣称他的聚合油公司已经完成这一使命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.99,0:13:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,并向全世界展示他的超级燃料的威力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他举办了一项史无前例的赛车锦标赛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,邀请最伟大的冠军选手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在首轮国际大奖赛中一争高下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,热烈欢迎，麦尔斯·艾克斯勒洛德
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，梅尔，很高兴上节目，请听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.07,0:13:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,大量使用石油，耗资巨大，加剧污染
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:14:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是化石燃料，什么叫化石？就像灭绝的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道它们是怎么灭绝的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.61,0:14:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,新能源是未来的趋势，相信我，梅尔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡是看过聚合油在国际大奖赛上的表现的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.51,0:14:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不会再回去用汽油了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.35,0:14:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那恐龙到底是怎么灭绝的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.72,0:14:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在卫星连线一位大奖赛的参赛选手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最快的车之一，弗朗西斯科·伯努利
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真荣幸，多拉先生，你真荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么没邀请闪电麦坤？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然邀请了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.63,0:14:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但显然，经过了这么长的赛季之后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想休息休息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.24,0:14:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤不会有机会赢弗朗西斯科的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.77,0:14:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每小时可以跑300公里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,换算成英里就是…总之比麦坤快多了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.01,0:14:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来进行电话连线
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,马里兰州巴尔的摩的听众，你的电话接通了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？你好？- 是的，请讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.39,0:14:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好？- 请说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来接通油车水镇的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.19,0:14:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位听众，你已经打进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们弄来的那个意大利家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:14:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许这样乱讲闪电麦坤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.19,0:15:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是全世界跑得最快的车
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢哦 - 如果他是，用你的说法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「跑得最快的车」，那他干嘛非要休息呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.40,0:15:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他知道什么是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他更喜欢时不时地放慢脚步，享受生活
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！你们听见了！闪电麦坤更喜欢慢慢开！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了，这对弗朗西斯来说不新鲜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.78,0:15:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想睡觉的时候就看他的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.18,0:15:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑完两圈之后，我就打瞌睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.85,0:15:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.62,0:15:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怕弗朗西斯科
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那辆意大利方程式赛车
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他叫… - 弗朗西斯科·伯努利
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.97,0:15:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 难怪都挤过来看 - 你怎么知道他名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.44,0:15:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么说话，好像大舌头似的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.37,0:15:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么嘛，他多帅呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.76,0:15:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,开放式轮胎，浑身上下都有型
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.87,0:15:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,挡泥板不好吗？我还以为你喜欢我的挡泥板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我告诉你吧 - 脱线？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤能围着你转圈跑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.42,0:15:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就只会转圈跑啊，不是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.48,0:15:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.59,0:16:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说，我是说，他不管在哪儿都能跑过你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管什么时候，什么赛道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅尔，我们能继续吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.59,0:16:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯科需要一位稍微聪明点的听众
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.53,0:16:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如一辆自卸卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈！丢人了吧，自卸车都是哑巴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，我是闪电麦坤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.74,0:16:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你那样侮辱我最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤，那是你最好的朋友？哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.11,0:16:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你和弗朗西斯科的不同之处了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯科知道自己有多棒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.68,0:16:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不需要拖车围在身边来证明这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.05,0:16:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是外强中干啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,外强中干！他说弗朗西斯科外强中干！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不够快，麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不够快」是你的新座右铭吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.87,0:16:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,座右铭？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.90,0:16:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来这事得在赛场上解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.91,0:16:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看怎么样，闪电麦坤？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:16:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还能再加一位选手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.14,0:17:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很乐意，不过我的团队已经休假了，所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:03.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（艾尔·雷欧·麦坤之队）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「加油维修站」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过呢，他们刚刚回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.95,0:17:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,算我一个，兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,咔嚓！耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我刚回来，不过我们不会去太久的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心我，我在这儿有很多事做
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过脱线会玩得很开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要带脱线去的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来没带他参加过你的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.31,0:17:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让他呆在维修站，给他戴个耳机
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应嘛，这肯定会是他这辈子最兴奋的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的饮料，先生 - 脱线
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没偷喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,想跟我来看看世界吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说真的？- 是啊，这事是你给我招来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也跑不了 - 太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:17:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.57,0:18:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.40,0:18:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！借过！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.05,0:19:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是多摩君，谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.49,0:20:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,圭多，看呀，法拉利，还有轮胎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快来！- 嗬嗬！看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.16,0:20:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起，脱线，要记住，要乖乖的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.47,0:20:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听你的，哥们儿，嘿，那是什么？- 脱线！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，麦坤！过来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 路易斯！- 嗨，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.47,0:20:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰夫！- 嗨，闪电
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个晚会真棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.28,0:20:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.55,0:20:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干得真不错，把叶子都清干净了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.85,0:20:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看那个拖车 - 不知道是跟谁一起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.45,0:20:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…不好意思，我离开一小会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗬嗬！干得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.19,0:20:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线！听着，这里不是油车水镇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.90,0:20:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才知道啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗬嗬！你还没倒过时差来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.73,0:20:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，这里跟家里不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说，你的举止也要跟在家时不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.61,0:20:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么个不一样法？- 就当帮我忙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.51,0:21:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要帮忙？哇塞，干嘛这么客气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱拖车就是干这个的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.15,0:21:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对，我是说… - 看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是圣弗朗西斯科先生，我来介绍你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.69,0:21:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要啊，脱线！- 看着我，我已经在帮你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，圣弗朗西斯科先生，我介绍你认识…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.19,0:21:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，闪电麦坤！晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.43,0:21:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 幸会，弗朗西斯科 - 幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.33,0:21:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来很帅，没我想得那么帅，但还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.23,0:21:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思，能合个影吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.20,0:21:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤的朋友就是我朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎莉小姐看到这个会高兴得跳起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是闪电麦坤的女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.61,0:21:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔！- 她是你的狂热粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，她品味不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.78,0:21:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线太夸张了，我不觉得她是「狂热粉丝」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，她是超级狂热粉丝！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.72,0:21:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没完没了地说你的开放式轮胎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就提过一次，哪有没完没了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯科对粉丝的狂热早就习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.66,0:21:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人热爱一辆车很正常，不需要掩饰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.83,0:21:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.47,0:21:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们干杯吧 - 我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:22:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,将我明日的胜利献给莎莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.17,0:22:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.27,0:22:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经把我明日的胜利献给她了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们都献就没意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.05,0:22:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 另外我也没有饮料 - 我去给你拿一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.58,0:22:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能不能跟他们借几块钱买饮料啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.09,0:22:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 饮料是免费的 - 免费？哇塞，那我还呆在这儿干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.59,0:22:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得看着他点儿，明天赛场上见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.69,0:22:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，你会见到弗朗西斯科的，但不是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是这样，并且离你越来越远
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.47,0:22:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈，还挺可爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.07,0:22:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给每辆参赛的车都画一个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.47,0:22:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.07,0:22:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜拜，麦坤！- 明天他一定输得很惨！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.68,0:22:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们，有请麦尔斯·艾克斯勒洛德
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.38,0:22:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我极其荣幸地向你们介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.19,0:22:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次国际赛车大奖赛的选手们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自巴西的8号…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.14,0:23:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢，你好 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.91,0:23:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么大众卡尔曼·吉亚没有散热器
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.61,0:23:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它采用风冷系统
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.42,0:23:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了，我是灵智速探员
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.42,0:23:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,东京站的霍莉·灵智速
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.22,0:23:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有来自伦敦的情报 - 别在这儿说
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.32,0:23:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝中楼的点心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验人员分析了我发的照片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.29,0:23:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于摄像机有什么发现？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.03,0:23:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来是一台标准的电视摄像机
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.30,0:23:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说最好你下次能拍到距离更近的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.54,0:23:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是伦敦的情报？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.91,0:23:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.24,0:23:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到的那个钻井平台
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,位于世界储油量最大的油田上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.05,0:23:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么会没发现它呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.35,0:23:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对所有的卫星都实施了干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.45,0:23:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人在你之前刚刚发现它
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.75,0:23:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那里安插了一位隐藏很深的卧底探员
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能弄到那辆车的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.08,0:24:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就知道是谁在背后操控一切了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.99,0:24:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.09,0:24:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哪辆车？有人见过照片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.06,0:24:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚美国人来这里把照片交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.87,0:24:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他准备好后会给你发信号
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.50,0:24:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，很好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.87,0:24:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.07,0:24:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 计划有变
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.07,0:24:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去见美国人 - 什么？我？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.08,0:24:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面那些恶棍就是钻井平台上的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.38,0:24:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们看见我，行动会暴露的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.51,0:24:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我是技术员，我是在实验室做分析的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.87,0:24:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我不是外勤探员
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.65,0:24:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.96,0:24:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我来一个，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.79,0:24:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,老是搞不清麦坤喜欢喝哪一种
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.30,0:24:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，你这儿有什么是免费的？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.21,0:24:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个开心果冰激凌免费吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.60,0:24:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不，这是芥末酱 - 差不多啦差不多啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.11,0:24:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？这东西看上去很好吃的样子啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.51,0:25:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…请再来点，不是免费的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.98,0:25:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续继续，再多来点
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.19,0:25:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来嘛，别舍不得，免费的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.95,0:25:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样，来一勺，一大勺
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.86,0:25:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了嘛，一大勺冰激凌！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.66,0:25:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,深表同情
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在出场的是我们最后一位选手
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.76,0:25:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,95号，闪电麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.47,0:25:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢您的邀请，艾克斯勒洛德先生
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.54,0:25:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很期待参加比赛，这是个很好的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.08,0:25:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，大家都很高兴，闪电
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.55,0:25:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的团队为比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.75,0:25:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,带来了卓越和专业的精神
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.89,0:25:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能给我点水！啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.16,0:25:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，凉快多了，凉快多了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.10,0:25:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何，不要吃免费的开心果冰激凌
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.44,0:25:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它变质啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.47,0:26:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾克斯勒洛德先生，很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.84,0:26:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是脱线，他… - 我认识他
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.68,0:26:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个把电话打进节目的家伙嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.32,0:26:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得谢谢你 - 不，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.18,0:26:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次旅行太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.92,0:26:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈，他有点兴奋，是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.42,0:26:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线！- 等等，我…哦，哇塞
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.86,0:26:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线 - 谁有毛巾？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.19,0:26:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，控制一下你自己，别出丑了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.80,0:26:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可我从来不漏油的，从来不漏 - 马上去拾掇一下自己！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.91,0:26:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让让！漏油了，卫生间在哪儿？谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.04,0:26:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得马上，哦，呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.08,0:26:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.18,0:26:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，女士们
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.28,0:26:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然漏油，我从来不漏油的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.25,0:26:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来不漏油，从来不，从来不
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.06,0:26:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我从来不漏油，唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.03,0:26:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来不漏油，从来不，从来…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.13,0:26:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.02,0:27:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，好痒啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.65,0:27:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哇哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.83,0:27:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦导弹，我到了，是时候放货了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.30,0:27:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，美国人激活了他的跟踪信号
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.87,0:27:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到，跟进
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.09,0:27:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下！嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.68,0:28:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦，开什么玩笑 - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.21,0:28:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在洗手间 - 那就进去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.11,0:28:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能进男厕所！- 时间紧急
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.88,0:28:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.29,0:28:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！不管怎么着，我是再也不进去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.90,0:28:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，格里莫林和步行者！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.57,0:28:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说你们的品牌和型号不好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.24,0:28:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过比起我那个被闲置不用的表妹贝茜
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.01,0:28:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们出故障更严重
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.97,0:28:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什…？哇，你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.34,0:28:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 嘿，拖车！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.51,0:28:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要谈点私事，你不介意回避下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.05,0:28:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.62,0:28:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我妨碍了你们谈私事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.22,0:29:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有点小忠告
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.36,0:29:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们听见咯咯笑声，看见瀑布的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.06,0:29:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好按绿色按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.03,0:29:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢 - 它是用来调节温度的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.26,0:29:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道了 - 是摄氏度，不是华氏度
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.96,0:29:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上消失！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.47,0:29:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好，等她开始咯咯笑的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.05,0:29:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就准备被喷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.44,0:29:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，女士
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.41,0:29:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的开心果冰激凌
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.41,0:29:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会是他吧？他是美国人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.15,0:29:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心了女士们，脱线要耍帅了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.58,0:29:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太像美国人了 - 那就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.55,0:29:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.15,0:29:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么大众卡尔曼·吉亚没有散热器
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.89,0:29:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不需要，因为它采用风冷系统
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.59,0:29:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了，嗯…我是东京站的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.43,0:29:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了，卡尔曼·吉亚不是唯一的一款
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.23,0:29:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有甲壳虫，3型方背式车身，盘式电动机
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.10,0:29:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的，我知道 - 而且在他们之前
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.50,0:29:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有2型客车
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.30,0:29:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我朋友菲尔莫就是一个 - 听着！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.57,0:29:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…我们应该找个更隐蔽的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.24,0:29:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天，你觉得有这样的地方吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.24,0:30:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,也对，没法知道哪个地方已经暴露了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.41,0:30:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么，我能再见到你吧？- 让我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.68,0:30:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明天，我会去赛场 - 明白
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.59,0:30:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就在那儿会合
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.12,0:30:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你回来了，刚才去哪儿了？- 「会合」是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.03,0:30:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃…有点像约会 - 约会？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.89,0:30:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.43,0:30:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,出的事就是明天我有个约会
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.26,0:30:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,圭多表示不相信
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.27,0:30:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信吧，我的新女友刚才说的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.44,0:30:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，她在哪儿呢，嗨！女士！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.51,0:30:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,明儿见！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.48,0:30:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,圭多表示依然不相信
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.01,0:30:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得承认，你把我们耍得团团转 - 我们不喜欢被人耍
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.95,0:30:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好笑的？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.89,0:30:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才我穿了一身很丑的伪装
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.42,0:30:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你们看起来很像
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.56,0:30:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚合油？谢了，伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.32,0:30:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说他们的东西不错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.23,0:30:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么想的？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.10,0:30:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚合油本身是不错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.70,0:30:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过经过深入研究
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.14,0:31:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现它有一个小缺陷
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.91,0:31:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当受到电磁脉冲冲击的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.81,0:31:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会变得极度危险
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.92,0:31:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,来笑一个
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.88,0:31:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要拍电影吗？我全程出演
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.99,0:31:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在钻井平台上的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.65,0:31:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这个摄像机非常感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.59,0:31:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你可以亲眼目睹它的真正作用了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.66,0:31:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 随你怎么说，教授 - 你昨晚跟很多车说过话
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.36,0:31:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪一辆是你的同伙？- 你妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.70,0:31:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不，我错了，是你妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.88,0:31:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直分不清她们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.34,0:31:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,能开始了吗，Z教授？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.21,0:31:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,加到50%动力值
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.48,0:31:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个摄像机实际上是电磁脉冲发射器
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.28,0:31:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她吗？你交给她了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.32,0:31:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚合油现在快要沸腾了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.72,0:31:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,会急剧膨胀，导致气缸在压力下爆裂
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.69,0:31:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把油压迫进燃烧室
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.23,0:31:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他吗？你跟他说过话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.56,0:31:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样，我可以换一个气缸
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.93,0:32:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧，不过如果脉冲波开到最大
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.34,0:32:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸，就什么也没法修了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.44,0:32:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他呢？给他了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.98,0:32:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他，就是他了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.42,0:32:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到，Z教授 - 不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.38,0:32:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.55,0:32:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信卧底送出了一些高度机密信息
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.92,0:32:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在造成严重后果之前我会解决的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.23,0:32:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动按原计划执行
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.96,0:32:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去找另外那个探员，干掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.08,0:32:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,日本，旭日之国
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.21,0:32:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,古代传统与现代科技在此相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.85,0:32:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎收看世界赛车大奖赛的现场报道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.75,0:32:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是布伦特·马斯唐伯格
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.80,0:32:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我身边的是两位传奇人物
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.95,0:32:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,达雷尔·卡特里普和大卫·霍布斯卡普
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.09,0:32:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一场前所未有的赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.72,0:33:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先，聚合油作为所有大型比赛的指定燃料
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.09,0:33:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,将于今晚首次亮相
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.23,0:33:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次是赛道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.16,0:33:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是我们前所未见的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.63,0:33:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫，这次比赛的规则究竟是什么样的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.20,0:33:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,三条赛道都是经典的环形跑道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.57,0:33:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着兰博基尼概念赛车和方程式赛车
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.57,0:33:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,将以最华丽的姿态冲出起跑线
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.07,0:33:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是弗朗西斯科·伯努利有望占据领先地位
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.01,0:33:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而高性能跑车和巡回车
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.24,0:33:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在所有的弯道处都可以扳回局面
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.05,0:33:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如西班牙的米格尔·卡米诺
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.58,0:33:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我怀疑仍不足以赶超弗朗西斯科
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.65,0:33:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他拥有绝对优势
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.59,0:33:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，呵呵，言之过早了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.22,0:33:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遗漏了一个重要因素
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.16,0:33:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是赛道前方的土路部分
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.13,0:33:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这场比赛中土路被用来平衡速度
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.20,0:33:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国拉力赛车拉乌尔·撒儒勒
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.47,0:33:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就期待在土路段提升速度
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.67,0:33:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别忘了闪电麦坤
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.70,0:33:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的教练，大黄蜂哈德森
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.44,0:33:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直是最厉害的土路赛车手
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.14,0:33:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来，麦坤是这次比赛中最全面的选手
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.01,0:33:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的，达雷尔
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.89,0:33:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该擦一下你的挡风玻璃了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.45,0:34:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一点你显然没看清：
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.19,0:34:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯科从没输过比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.25,0:34:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候揭晓疑问了，参赛者已经就位
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.66,0:34:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度，我就是速度
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.87,0:34:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？你就是速度？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.30,0:34:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那弗朗西斯科就是三倍速度
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.34,0:34:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯科是三倍速度
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗬嗬！弗朗西斯科喜欢麦坤
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.91,0:34:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿他别落得太远
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.91,0:34:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我要他好看
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.61,0:35:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的悬架不错 - 胎压很正常！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.55,0:35:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他燃料充足 - 他帅呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.99,0:35:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么在维修站？太容易暴露了 - 那是伪装
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.56,0:35:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是我见过的最好的伪装，瞧那些锈斑的细节
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.73,0:35:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定花了他一大笔钱
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.20,0:35:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可他怎么还不联系我们 - 可能他不方便
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.40,0:35:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要有耐心 - 好的，一定
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.40,0:35:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时机到了他会给我们发信号 - 那就能找出幕后黑手了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.71,0:35:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进入了第一个U形弯道，弗朗西斯科领先
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.24,0:35:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住，小伙子们，就要进入土路了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.85,0:35:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,飘移再加侧滑，宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.51,0:35:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤，你的机会来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.48,0:35:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,上外圈，把医生教你的本事拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.02,0:35:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了，脱线
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.36,0:35:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦天哪！弗朗西斯科来了个急刹车！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.36,0:36:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤第一个把握住时机
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.03,0:36:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众们，弗朗西斯科在土路上失去了领先地位
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.20,0:36:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意，脱线，继续哦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.10,0:36:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢嗬！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.67,0:36:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤看上去比德贝冲撞赛上的保护杆还开心
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.44,0:36:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到柏油路面之后每辆车都在争抢位置
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.68,0:36:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯科在土路上势头大减
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.62,0:36:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要想重回首位需要加倍努力
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.63,0:36:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,选手们到达了彩虹桥，这里是360度的弯道
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.41,0:36:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是时候了 - 收到
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.19,0:36:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！米格尔·卡米诺气缸爆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.69,0:37:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪，达雷尔，他今年一直发挥稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.69,0:37:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开什么玩笑 - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.49,0:37:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 厕所里那个拖车 - 厕所里的拖车？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.86,0:37:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国特工把设备交给他了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.20,0:37:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么了？- 他在维修站！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.60,0:37:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他呆不久了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.31,0:37:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等，我有发现 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.46,0:37:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚晚会上的那辆步行者
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.84,0:37:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来和钻井台的照片做个比对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.05,0:37:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，他的车辆识别号是匹配的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.78,0:37:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人和他一起吗？他不可能单独行动
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.62,0:37:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行目标分析，他不是单独行动的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.72,0:37:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,三辆，五辆…到处都是，他们正在接近…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.96,0:37:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦不！芬恩？芬恩，你在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.03,0:37:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他离开维修站，快！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.73,0:37:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢！有些家伙真能嚷嚷啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.66,0:37:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能听见吗？完毕 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.13,0:37:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上离开维修站！听见了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.90,0:37:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我认识你！你是昨天晚会上的姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.47,0:37:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想现在就约会吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.31,0:37:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们儿，别闲聊了，线路要保持畅通
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.34,0:37:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,10号冒烟了，克拉奇冈斯基！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.38,0:38:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.65,0:38:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间胡闹了，离开维修站！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.85,0:38:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去的地方有信号吗？我还想继续看比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.39,0:38:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没时间了！- 他们来了，把他弄走！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.66,0:38:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想办法呢，现在就出去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.06,0:38:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我通常在见女性朋友之前喜欢正式打扮一下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.10,0:38:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.54,0:38:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 芬恩·麦导弹！你不是死了吗？- 那现在就不会伤心了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.15,0:38:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵智速小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.69,0:38:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让他去车库东边的后巷
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.09,0:38:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,众多攻击者正迅速接近
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.53,0:38:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他一直开，我这就过来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.83,0:38:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，姑娘，你喜欢花吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.97,0:38:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.03,0:38:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！哪儿也别去，一直开
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.60,0:38:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呆在外面，我来啦 - 外面？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.77,0:39:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢！麦坤突然跑到外圈
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.38,0:39:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.18,0:39:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做太愚蠢了，就这么让开了内道！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.15,0:39:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能会使麦坤丢掉冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.17,0:39:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我要确保你必死无疑！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.01,0:39:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得很好，保持注意力集中
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.48,0:39:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事？要我去看看那边吵什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.05,0:39:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！别到那条街上去
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.35,0:39:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.86,0:39:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.13,0:39:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢！空手道表演！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.46,0:39:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,住嘴，脱线，关掉广播
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.50,0:40:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.97,0:40:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位选手在争夺领先位置
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.84,0:40:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们接近终点线了！保险杠挨着保险杠！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.25,0:40:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胜利在望！- 弗朗西斯科获胜！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.48,0:40:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤获得亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.42,0:40:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真酷！能给我签个名吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.86,0:40:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.43,0:40:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们见面很危险，请保证设备安全
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.47,0:40:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们保持联系 - 哎呀，我错过约会了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.24,0:40:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弗朗西斯科！- 弗朗西斯科，看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.01,0:40:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天采取的是什么战术？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.61,0:40:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,战术？弗朗西斯科不需要战术
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.48,0:40:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,太简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.72,0:40:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,起跑，等着麦坤熄火，超过他，然后就赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.86,0:40:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯科总是赢，真不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.26,0:41:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你状态不好有一阵子了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.63,0:41:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,土路那段赛道你简直是爬过去的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.66,0:41:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要真正粉碎一个人的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.96,0:41:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须先让他产生很高的期望
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.23,0:41:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线！- 嘿，麦坤！怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.17,0:41:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛结束了？你赢了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.30,0:41:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我比赛的时候瞎嚷嚷什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.77,0:41:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞎嚷嚷？哦，你以为…真有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.74,0:41:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的，因为我看见两个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.15,0:41:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在街头做空手道表演
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.32,0:41:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,都玩疯了，其中一个居然还拿着喷火器
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.88,0:41:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喷火器？你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.45,0:41:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我搞不懂，你去哪儿了？- 去赴约啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.29,0:41:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,赴约？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.93,0:41:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟我说话，告诉我到哪儿去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.69,0:41:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音好像就在我脑子里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.10,0:41:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.30,0:41:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没给你添乱吧？- 我输了比赛，就因为你！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.00,0:41:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，对不起，我不是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.57,0:41:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象出来的女朋友？喷火器？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.71,0:41:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我不带你到这种场合来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.08,0:41:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许如果我…我也不知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.28,0:41:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟什么人说说，解释一下，这个我能帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.58,0:42:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你帮忙！我不想要你帮忙！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.15,0:42:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，他在那儿！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.72,0:42:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦坤，冠军本来已经是你的了！- 是啊！怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.59,0:42:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我犯了个错误
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.33,0:42:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我向你们保证，以后不会再犯了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.16,0:42:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我向你们保证，以后不会再犯了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.53,0:42:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道问题出在哪儿，我们会解决的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.97,0:42:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第一届世界赛车大奖赛中
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.34,0:42:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤在最后一圈输给了弗朗西斯科·伯努利
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.91,0:42:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且有三辆车，就是这三辆，燃烧熄火
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.81,0:42:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有暗示说他们的燃料聚合油应该承担责任
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.55,0:42:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚合油是安全的，可替代燃料是安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.05,0:42:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的燃料不可能造成这些车燃烧熄火
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.59,0:42:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,评审团也许还没有得出结论说聚合油引发了事故
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.13,0:42:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一件事确定无疑
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.56,0:42:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤输掉了比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.13,0:42:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤团队现在一定心情沉重
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.61,0:43:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到东京国际机场
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.83,0:43:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请跟我来，先生 - 可我要误飞机了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.80,0:43:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边走 - 啊，怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.67,0:43:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我的钩子吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.64,0:43:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道应该先检查一下，但我真没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.64,0:43:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，它是固定的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.21,0:43:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我认识你，你就是那个表演空手道的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.65,0:43:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没正式自我介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.02,0:43:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩·麦导弹，英国情报局
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.49,0:43:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖车脱线，普通智商
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.46,0:43:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪个机构工作？联邦调查局？中情局？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.19,0:43:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当我是美国汽车协会的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.29,0:43:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会一些空手道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.63,0:44:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是吹牛或者炫耀，不过我是黑带哦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.23,0:44:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想看看我自己编的动作吗？- 你被跟踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.27,0:44:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个动作，打开一辆车发动机罩
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.24,0:44:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔出电池，在他熄火之前给他看
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.08,0:44:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我称之为「跟我的朋友路易吉开的一次玩笑」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.31,0:44:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！嗨呀啪！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.12,0:44:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿呀！- 他在那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.95,0:44:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨嗨哒嗬！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.89,0:44:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说，我得走了，航班要误了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.72,0:44:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别担心，交给我了 - 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.06,0:44:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.90,0:44:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.16,0:44:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是头等舱服务
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.47,0:44:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不用走客运站！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.64,0:44:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的空手道搭档回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.84,0:44:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看起来很赶时间啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.11,0:44:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只管开，无论如何别停！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.28,0:44:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇！- 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.33,0:45:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哇哇
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.80,0:45:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.37,0:45:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩，我是西德，我快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.54,0:45:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.18,0:45:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你告诉我无论如何不要停下的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.55,0:45:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道行李应该随身带！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.09,0:45:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，老朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.19,0:45:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题，伙计 - 嘿，别挡路
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.52,0:45:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我想象出来的女朋友嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.52,0:45:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，进来！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.16,0:45:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对第一次约会真看重呀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.96,0:45:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是永不放弃，精神可嘉
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.13,0:45:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么搞…？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.37,0:45:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊！- 坚持住，西德
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.15,0:45:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.22,0:46:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，芬恩！再不上就来不及了！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.76,0:46:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.70,0:46:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你读到这封信的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.89,0:46:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经平安登上回家的飞机了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.37,0:46:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你读到这封信的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.21,0:46:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经平安登上回家的飞机了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.70,0:46:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉我做错了事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.44,0:46:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我不想让你再输掉更多的比赛了」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.61,0:46:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我要向世界证明我所知道的」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.25,0:46:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你才是全世界跑得最快的车」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.75,0:46:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你最好的朋友，脱线」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.25,0:46:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想真让他离开的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.35,0:46:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，还有几页
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.79,0:46:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,「另：请告诉宾馆」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.59,0:46:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我不是真的想订那部电影看」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.89,0:46:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我以为只是预告片，没想到要花钱的」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.63,0:46:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,「再另：玩得很开心」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.77,0:46:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有好几页的「另」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.67,0:46:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了，至少我们知道他在家，平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.41,0:47:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这样开始每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.41,0:47:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有在面对死亡的时候才会感觉充满生机
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.18,0:47:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，但愿设备没有掉下来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.28,0:47:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.62,0:47:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我赶航班最千钧一发的一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.39,0:47:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是…哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.27,0:47:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是…哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.69,0:47:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 毫发无损？好极了 - 我得去看医生
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.99,0:47:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的底盘疼得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.43,0:47:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正在下载照片 - 我来给你们两个介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.70,0:47:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是叫芬恩·麦什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.80,0:47:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,机场的头等贵宾什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.37,0:47:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位呢，芬恩，是我的约会对象
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.11,0:47:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直不知道你名字
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.87,0:47:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，抱歉，我是灵智速，霍莉·灵智速
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.11,0:47:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是灵智速，霍莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.98,0:47:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算可以看到幕后黑手了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.45,0:47:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.38,0:47:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是世上最差劲的引擎之一
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.19,0:47:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧的铝制V型8缸，卢卡斯电力系统
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.50,0:47:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,惠特沃斯螺栓
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.99,0:47:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇塞，惠特沃斯螺栓最麻烦了，为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.26,0:47:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的长度单位既不是米，也不是英寸
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.13,0:47:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了，知道了，不过这是谁的引擎呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.90,0:48:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从照片上很难看出来，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.53,0:48:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可这是你拍的 - 霍莉
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.20,0:48:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，是啊，当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.27,0:48:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个好探员要尽其所能弄到情报
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.13,0:48:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要在被干掉之前脱身
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.47,0:48:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,代理？你是指保险代理这种？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.68,0:48:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,远亲不如近邻，有麻烦找脱线
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.28,0:48:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！你说的是秘密特工！你们是侦探！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.42,0:48:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,能在多少品牌和型号里找到这款引擎？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.62,0:48:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它符合7个型号，12年以上的使用期
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.26,0:48:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少有35，000辆车使用这款引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.73,0:48:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真美 - 谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.06,0:48:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 人又这么好 - 专心点
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.73,0:48:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来走到死胡同了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.64,0:48:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是照片里有什么东西能缩小调查范围
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.46,0:48:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会开心一点的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.51,0:48:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能不会开心，不过我打赌这家伙会
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.38,0:48:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没，他把大部分零件都换掉了？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.78,0:48:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到旁边这些盒子了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.75,0:48:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是原件，不容易买到的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.75,0:48:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 稀缺零件？- 我们可以追踪这个
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.85,0:48:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.52,0:49:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好，脱线，我就不会注意到那些
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.46,0:49:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识巴黎的一个黑市零件商，一个奸诈小人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.26,0:49:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他是唯一能告诉我们这些引擎来源的车了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.93,0:49:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，我们成立一个非正式的行动小组如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.70,0:49:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.87,0:49:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你显然对这个领域很有经验
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.14,0:49:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，我旁边就有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.94,0:49:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.61,0:49:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近我好像什么人也帮不上忙
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.55,0:49:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮了我的忙，请吧，脱线
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.28,0:49:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.99,0:49:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你知道我只是辆拖车吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.22,0:49:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道，我也只是做进出口贸易的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.69,0:49:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 西德？- 什么，芬恩？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.39,0:49:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上去巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.96,0:49:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，他们两个对我也太好了，西德
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.63,0:49:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想当侦探
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.70,0:49:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.40,0:49:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要打开加力助燃吗，长官？- 还有其他办法吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.02,0:50:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.14,0:50:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进去之后，要跟紧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.17,0:50:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用费神查识别号码，这里的都是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.57,0:50:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.94,0:50:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别和任何人说话，别看任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.98,0:50:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且绝对，千万不要闲逛，明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.95,0:50:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，不要闲逛，没问题，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.65,0:50:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线？- 什么，芬恩？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.62,0:50:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不是来逛街的 - 逛街？什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.89,0:50:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.86,0:50:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.46,0:50:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 零件特卖，先生 - 先生，零件便宜卖
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.56,0:50:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿真是什么都有，看呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.60,0:50:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动机罩！我缺一个发动机罩
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.07,0:50:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉了伙计，我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.90,0:50:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢，哇，嘻嘻！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.31,0:50:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.31,0:51:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了，你卖的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.18,0:51:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,头灯，先生，头灯要吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.01,0:51:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 里面是…？- 买一送一
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.85,0:51:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你优惠价格！- 不用了！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.32,0:51:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到你了 - 这里有好些便宜货
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.66,0:51:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线，退后！- 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.90,0:51:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，等等我！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.39,0:51:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.49,0:51:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.09,0:51:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了吗？- 我以为…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.43,0:51:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙需要拖车，把他拖走
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.53,0:51:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.13,0:51:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个生锈的垃圾！把你的破钩子拿远点！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.55,0:52:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,电击！开什么玩笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.58,0:52:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她第一次外出执勤，不知道你是我的线人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.52,0:52:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 线人？- 新手，哼？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.85,0:52:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向不喜欢新车的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.46,0:52:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没记错的话我第一次把托博尔救出来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.39,0:52:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在摩洛哥的拘留所里关着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.40,0:52:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到回忆，你到那儿也没有白去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.13,0:52:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了，你们两个认识，而且都是老爷车
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.27,0:52:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就交给你了，线人，给我们线索吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.81,0:52:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼！这真是最烂的发动机
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.48,0:52:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，那个滤油器，还有那些轴承
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.91,0:52:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,托博尔，那些零件眼熟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.08,0:52:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该眼熟，是我卖的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.15,0:52:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卖给谁？- 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.75,0:52:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我最好的顾客，但他只通过电话下单
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.56,0:52:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直奇怪他怎么需要那么多零件
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.76,0:52:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.59,0:52:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,柠檬车就需要零件，这是千真万确的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.83,0:53:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 柠檬车？- 对，那些天生就老出故障的车
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.97,0:53:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,柠檬车就是拖车的衣食父母
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.17,0:53:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那些格里莫林和步行者，我们在晚会上碰见的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.07,0:53:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有赛场上和机场上
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.74,0:53:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍莉，拉出钻井平台上的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.84,0:53:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道还有其它什么型号的车在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.34,0:53:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我们看看，还有雨果和特朗考夫
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.15,0:53:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些车也是柠檬车吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.98,0:53:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,教皇专车是天主教徒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.95,0:53:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一辆被卷入阴谋的车都是史上最失败车型
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.02,0:53:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他们听从这台引擎背后那辆车的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.56,0:53:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊，这就解释得通了 - 怎么，托博尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.23,0:53:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里莫林，步行者，雨果和特朗考夫
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.63,0:53:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从没一起出现过
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.83,0:53:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们这两天内有一个秘密集会
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.50,0:53:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 集会地点在哪儿？- 意大利波图科萨
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.74,0:53:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是下场比赛的地点！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.51,0:53:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是个好机会在那儿见到我们的神秘引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.31,0:53:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是天赐良机
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.38,0:53:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨天刚给他送了一台离合器总成
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.86,0:53:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,发到波图科萨
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.58,0:53:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,联络史蒂文森，让他在里昂车站与我们会合
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.72,0:53:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.99,0:54:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个三轮车说的集会的事肯定是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.00,0:54:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还从来没在一个城市里见到这么多柠檬车呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.10,0:54:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非这儿有个跳蚤市场
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.00,0:54:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么拍到他们的照片的？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.87,0:54:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重写了波图科萨的交通摄像系统
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.55,0:54:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过这个系统进行识别扫描
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.11,0:54:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇，你不仅是我见过的车里最美的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.40,0:54:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是最聪明的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.75,0:54:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你…我想
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.75,0:54:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,多熟悉的场景啊，一辆雨果被拖走
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.38,0:54:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他看起来完整无缺啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.32,0:54:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了！他们一定是柠檬车家族的头目
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.42,0:54:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有道理，我要是有钱，还每天出故障
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.43,0:54:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会雇我自己拖着我自己走！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.83,0:54:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得潜入那个集会，看看是谁在操控
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.83,0:54:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 稍等，别动 - 噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.61,0:54:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈！干得漂亮，灵智速小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.78,0:54:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，芬恩
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.11,0:54:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪，真希望我朋友看看我现在的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.42,0:55:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,圭多，你的眼睛没有欺骗你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.92,0:55:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在意大利，我们回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.36,0:55:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，路易吉，去旅馆怎么走？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.36,0:55:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？在我老家，绝不会让朋友去住旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.63,0:55:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们住在我…叔叔托波利诺！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.57,0:55:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易吉！圭多！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.61,0:55:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是怎么做的？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.58,0:55:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们在家用的原料是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.66,0:55:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但味道怎么这么好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.99,0:55:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是有机的，兄弟 - 你这个「拥抱树木」的嬉皮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.83,0:55:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，赛车
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.79,0:55:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来这么垂头丧气的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.83,0:55:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像轮胎没气了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.27,0:55:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说你看起来好像饿坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.14,0:55:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要给你做顿大餐，把你喂的饱饱的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.71,0:55:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.98,0:56:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,托波利诺妈妈，不用这么麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.51,0:56:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.31,0:56:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友之间闹别扭了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.52,0:56:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,您怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.75,0:56:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明的车一向善于察言观色
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.49,0:56:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是路易吉告诉我的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.13,0:56:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁着妈妈做饭，跟我去散散步吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.89,0:56:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次比赛我带我的朋友脱线一起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.33,0:56:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他得注意言行举止
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.67,0:56:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟我们不是在油车水镇
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.33,0:56:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位脱线是你很好的朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.74,0:56:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.57,0:56:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么要让他变成另一个样子呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.81,0:56:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.51,0:56:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在我们争执的时候说了些话
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.55,0:56:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前圭多和路易吉帮我干活的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.69,0:56:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为各种各样的事情争吵
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.02,0:56:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪种法拉利是最好的法拉利
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.63,0:56:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们哪一个更像法拉利
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.43,0:56:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至还有跟法拉利无关的争吵
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.80,0:57:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就告诉他们「没问题，吵就吵吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.00,0:57:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,「每个人都吵架，特别是和最好的朋友」
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.64,0:57:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,「但你们得赶快和好」
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.54,0:57:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「友谊比什么争执都重要」
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.05,0:57:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么意思？- 拥有朋友，就拥有财富
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.59,0:57:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，小伙子，吃吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.21,0:57:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩，还有一小时到波图科萨
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.41,0:57:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，史蒂文森
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.24,0:57:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该差不多了 - 一级棒
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.65,0:57:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了，脱线，这是声控的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.41,0:57:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过如今什么都是声控的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.28,0:57:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我以为你们要给我做伪装呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.69,0:57:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音已识别，伪装程序启动
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.06,0:57:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.26,0:57:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑，我要变德国卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.43,0:58:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请求已确认 - 看啊！我穿上背带裤了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.60,0:58:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要变巨无霸卡车！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.80,0:58:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请求已确认 - 这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.80,0:58:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要吸干你们的汽油！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.90,0:58:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在把我变成玉米卷售卖车！- 请求已确认
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.31,0:58:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特种赛车！- 请求已确认
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.01,0:58:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪装是为了不引起引人注意，脱线
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.15,0:58:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就混进去，伪装成这辆卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.52,0:58:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 剩下的就交给我们了 - 现在别动
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.42,0:58:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伪装还要做点最后的调整
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.43,0:58:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个不行
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.43,0:58:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你要干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.06,0:58:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,表面不光滑的话，伪装会衔接不好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.04,0:58:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一会儿，我猜你是要修补我的凹痕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.04,0:58:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 不了，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.51,0:58:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想给我的凹痕抛光，填平，上漆什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.48,0:58:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们很珍贵 - 凹痕很珍贵？真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.98,0:59:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,每道凹痕都是跟我最好的朋友麦坤一起玩弄上的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.12,0:59:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要修补，我要永远记住它们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.79,0:59:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那巴黎的事是真的了？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.01,0:59:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤不只是你用来掩饰身份的？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.26,0:59:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,做我们这样的工作交朋友是很危险的，脱线
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.33,0:59:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的工作就是拖吊和援救啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.47,0:59:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，灵智速小姐还是设计iPhone程序的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.67,0:59:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不，我是说真的 - 没事没事，我在凹痕附近操作就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.11,0:59:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 另外…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.41,0:59:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像还缺几把武器呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.96,0:59:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,波图科萨，坐落于意大利的里维埃拉
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.79,0:59:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么美丽而充满生气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.23,0:59:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于世界赛车大奖赛第二站来说环境非常理想
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.46,0:59:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊布伦特，此地被称为「里维埃拉的明珠」
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.39,0:59:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,原因不言而喻
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.13,0:59:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,海滨幽静，赌场遍布
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.93,0:59:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,波图科萨真是富人们的天堂
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.87,0:59:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而今天，各路人士欢聚于此
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.94,1:00:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,从超级富豪到超级明星
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.07,1:00:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,和世界级的达官贵人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.54,1:00:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所言不虚，大卫
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.41,1:00:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要做个三点转向，就会撞上个把名人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.81,1:00:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎各位来到世界赛车大奖赛的第二站
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.31,1:00:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚合油的新闻依然占据头条
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.88,1:00:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦尔斯·艾克斯勒洛德爵士于今天早些时候
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.82,1:00:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就安全性问题回答了媒体提问
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.12,1:00:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一支独立的科学调查团已经做出结论
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.93,1:00:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,认为聚合油是绝对安全的，行了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.06,1:00:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是安全的，就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.70,1:00:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此比赛会继续，观众们
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.43,1:00:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但每个人都关心的问题是：
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.27,1:00:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤会展现出他的冠军本色吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.04,1:00:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是这样，说到主场优势
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.14,1:00:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯科·伯努利就是在这种赛道上长大的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.14,1:00:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们，成绩领先的1号，弗朗西斯科！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.11,1:00:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女们！谢谢你们的支持！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.35,1:00:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也谢谢你的重大失误，麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.95,1:00:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,屈居第二位的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.45,1:00:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,95号，闪电麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.49,1:01:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤，你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.26,1:01:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你担心燃料，那没必要，它绝对安全
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.83,1:01:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是，我只是希望脱线也在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.77,1:01:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯科理解你，麦坤
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.80,1:01:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，又来了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.87,1:01:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么，弗朗西斯科？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.91,1:01:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于著名的赛车来说，比如弗朗西斯科
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.46,1:01:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然还有你
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.31,1:01:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离家乡是很难过的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.35,1:01:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像忘了损我了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.58,1:01:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是损你
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.22,1:01:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯科出门在外的时候，会想念他的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.29,1:01:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你想念你的拖车朋友一样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.19,1:01:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,天，我以前是不是误会了你，这实在是…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.33,1:01:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了，现在我就在家门口，而且我妈妈就在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.60,1:01:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.56,1:01:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，妈妈，麦坤很不开心
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.77,1:01:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我会打这个爱哭宝宝的屁屁的！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.24,1:01:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才到损我的部分
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.46,1:02:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,达雷尔，赛车们已经就位了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.99,1:02:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,正向着意大利乡村进发
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.39,1:02:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，小伙子们！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.43,1:02:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是一场伟大的比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.24,1:02:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里莫林，伙计们，这些车可真丑
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.28,1:02:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像有谁想偷他们的后备箱似的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.25,1:02:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的祖父抛锚了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.66,1:02:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有谁能帮一把，我会感激不尽的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.59,1:02:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来你需要道路援助
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.70,1:02:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她跟我说话呢 - 是吗？谁能证明？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.03,1:02:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别因为我吵架
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.07,1:02:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖车先生，劳驾了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.04,1:02:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好，脱线，随时行动
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.44,1:03:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会啊，要是搞砸了怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.28,1:03:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.91,1:03:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,正常发挥就好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.05,1:03:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,演好傻瓜拖车的角色就可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.62,1:03:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是那些家伙看起来很难对付…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.11,1:03:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，你说「傻瓜」？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.02,1:03:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是这么看我的？- 每个人都这么看你的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.13,1:03:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你的策略吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.66,1:03:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说，这就是你的天才之处
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.70,1:03:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都意识不到自己被你耍了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.87,1:03:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们光顾着嘲笑那个傻瓜了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.54,1:03:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高明！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.14,1:03:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么还没伪装好？- 我…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.34,1:03:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点！没时间了！赶紧！- 好吧，好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.65,1:03:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 电脑，伪装！- 请求已确认
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.62,1:03:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板来了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.30,1:03:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊万
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.33,1:03:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，呃…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.07,1:04:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊万，你怎么这么无礼，把我晾在这里？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.95,1:04:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他上场了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.88,1:04:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛车们正在绕着U型弯道转弯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.65,1:04:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后向山下的赌场桥开去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.77,1:04:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,请停止下注
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.47,1:04:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，绒毛骰子！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.11,1:04:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 四点 - 耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.14,1:04:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,空气清新剂，天线球
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.18,1:04:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,火花塞
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.08,1:04:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方看起来像是金子砌的！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.55,1:04:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它就是，现在说话要注意
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.95,1:04:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为啥？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.99,1:04:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫「不要跟你说话」？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.02,1:04:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我现在就不要跟你说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.53,1:04:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天怪怪的，伊万
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.29,1:05:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.23,1:05:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,「亚历克桑德·雨果，也叫拆车铺亚历克斯」
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.57,1:05:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字还真多，亚历克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.60,1:05:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过也有道理
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.68,1:05:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，你在这么多国家都被通缉，法国，德国…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.74,1:05:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，住嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.78,1:05:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了行了，小点声！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.21,1:05:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要招来警察了！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.25,1:05:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天别惹伊万，他心情不好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.85,1:05:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真出色！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.12,1:05:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克多！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.49,1:05:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，维克多！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.86,1:05:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来了！- 请进！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.42,1:05:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克多·雨果，我是J·科比·格里莫林，从底特律来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.66,1:05:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.53,1:05:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,大老板来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.47,1:05:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还没有 - 他应该随时会来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.47,1:05:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要出场了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.78,1:05:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,日安
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.24,1:05:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是教授而已
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.35,1:05:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,泽达普，他什么时候来？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.05,1:05:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经到了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.99,1:06:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位好
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.45,1:06:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望能诸位共同庆祝这个特殊的日子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.79,1:06:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的离合器总成坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.89,1:06:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们了解是怎么回事 - 别提了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.09,1:06:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们了解你的感受
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.83,1:06:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 解码那个声音 - 我正在尝试
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.10,1:06:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，太复杂了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.30,1:06:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来此庆祝的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.84,1:06:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天，所有的努力将得到回报
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.91,1:06:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这样的车被整个世界所抛弃
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.71,1:06:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们停止生产我们，停止制造我们的配件
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.25,1:06:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一没有停止的就是嘲笑我们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.45,1:06:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们起丑陋的名字：老爷车，锈铁桶，废铁堆
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.32,1:06:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧机器，破汽车，旧汽车，破烂儿，破铜烂铁
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.39,1:06:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,柠檬车
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.80,1:06:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们的侮辱赐予我们力量
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.43,1:06:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为到了今天，我的朋友们，一切都将结束！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.61,1:06:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌场桥上冒烟了！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.81,1:06:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦不！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.91,1:06:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是卡拉·维罗索，巴西赛车！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.52,1:07:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了？- 我正在查
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.55,1:07:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们嘲笑我们，但现在轮到我们嘲笑他们了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.49,1:07:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一起故障！是9号，奈杰尔·吉斯利
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.16,1:07:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥抱你们自己的柠檬吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.96,1:07:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它来驱动你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.70,1:07:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我检测到一股极强的电磁脉冲
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.07,1:07:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 芬恩，是那台摄像机 - 在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.07,1:07:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔上！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.24,1:07:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将成为新燃料最伟大的时刻
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.38,1:07:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今天过后，每个人都会用回汽油
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.32,1:07:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们，世界最大的未开发原油储备的拥有者
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.39,1:07:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,将成为世界上最有权势的汽车！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.13,1:07:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.86,1:08:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会回来找我们，别无选择，因为他们需要我们
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.24,1:08:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.44,1:08:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们算准了你会来！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.18,1:08:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们最终会尊敬我们！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.92,1:08:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,高举你们的引擎盖吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.22,1:08:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天过后，你们再也不用为自己的身份而羞愧了！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.66,1:08:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.54,1:08:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.46,1:08:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,柠檬车万岁！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.43,1:09:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,7号车爆胎了，轰木秀！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.75,1:09:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.86,1:09:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以微弱差距冲过终点线！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.56,1:09:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤获胜！弗朗西斯科第二名！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.56,1:09:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们完全不知道身后发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.10,1:09:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.66,1:09:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我嘛！咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.67,1:09:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.57,1:09:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其他车呢？- 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.10,1:09:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.25,1:09:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾克斯勒洛德爵士，伦敦最后一站还会如期举行吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.98,1:09:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.02,1:09:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛必须进行下去，就像他们说的那样
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.39,1:10:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信居然成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.52,1:10:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.72,1:10:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会要求所有赛车依然使用聚合油燃料吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.89,1:10:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭良心说，我不能继续拿任何赛车来冒险了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.33,1:10:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,终点赛不需要使用聚合油
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.24,1:10:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众们都看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.12,1:10:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦尔斯·艾克斯勒洛德爵士显然深受打击
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.01,1:10:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣布他不再要求选手在终点赛上使用聚合油
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.28,1:10:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.68,1:10:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺聚合油和新能源永远灭亡！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.45,1:10:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，任务中止
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.42,1:10:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们抓走了芬恩，离开这里，马上离开
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.56,1:10:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你祖父怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.36,1:10:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,柠檬万岁！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.43,1:10:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这派对真棒，嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.86,1:10:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，难以置信
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.73,1:10:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会要走吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.90,1:10:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…我当然不走
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.93,1:10:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我感到十分震惊 - 麦坤？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.83,1:10:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我感到十分震惊 - 麦坤？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.54,1:10:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道出故障是比赛中的常事
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.57,1:10:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但像这样的事故从没发生过
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.87,1:10:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在决赛中你会选择什么燃料？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.48,1:10:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚合油
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.08,1:11:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使出了今天这样的事？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.45,1:11:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友菲尔莫说它是安全的，对我来说就足够了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.48,1:11:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近我不够信任我的一位朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.95,1:11:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再次犯同样的错误
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.29,1:11:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤发表了惊人的宣言
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.32,1:11:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将不顾今天的事故，继续在决赛中使用聚合油
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.06,1:11:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …直到闪电麦坤死掉 - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.77,1:11:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚合油必须永久性终结
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.60,1:11:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤不能赢决赛
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.74,1:11:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤必须被清除！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.11,1:11:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.48,1:11:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个美国间谍！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.82,1:11:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回够呛了！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.02,1:11:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,格特林机枪，请求已确认
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.19,1:11:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下，所有人趴下！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.22,1:11:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇塞！我说的不是「枪」… 请求已确认
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.14,1:12:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！等等！我说的不是「发射」！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.61,1:12:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,更正已确认，发送降落伞
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.81,1:12:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.38,1:12:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.99,1:12:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.42,1:12:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.73,1:12:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤！麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.53,1:12:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.07,1:12:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我过去！让我过去！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.04,1:12:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我进去！我要去警告麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.51,1:12:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能进去！后退
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.61,1:12:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,9号门这儿有个疯子
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.11,1:12:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我伪装成一辆拖车混进柠檬车头目的聚会
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.02,1:12:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的武器系统理解错了我的话
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.12,1:12:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 9号门有疯子 - 麦坤！麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.89,1:12:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是冠军！- 走这边，先生
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.16,1:12:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦坤！- 脱线！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.23,1:12:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦坤 - 摆个姿势！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.73,1:13:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦坤！- 别动，停下！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.13,1:13:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.31,1:13:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.53,1:13:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.77,1:13:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦坤！- 听起来真像…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.27,1:13:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.54,1:13:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线？- 先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.17,1:13:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤！他们要杀了你！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.34,1:13:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.84,1:13:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.24,1:13:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别，你要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.11,1:13:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.95,1:13:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦坤！- 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.65,1:13:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线！脱线！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.15,1:13:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，看见你真高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.19,1:13:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤！我是你的忠实粉丝
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.36,1:13:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，我还以为我看见了…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.09,1:13:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我对你说话
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.73,1:13:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说「你今天杀了其他车的风头，你是最棒的」
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.16,1:13:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？我是说谢谢 - 走这边，先生
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.00,1:13:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的以为听见了我朋友的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.80,1:13:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在英国，你会走到终点的！就在终点线
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.21,1:13:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等，什么？- 媒体在等着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.58,1:13:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.32,1:13:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.75,1:13:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是很关心那辆赛车
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.35,1:13:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你没能及时通知他
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.16,1:14:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「傻瓜」？你是这么看我的？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.16,1:14:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说，这就是你的天才之处
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.33,1:14:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都意识不到自己被你耍了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.44,1:14:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们光顾着嘲笑那个傻瓜了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.31,1:14:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑那个傻瓜…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.78,1:14:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.71,1:14:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是多摩君！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.68,1:14:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.38,1:14:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.38,1:14:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干得不错，把叶子都清干净了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.32,1:14:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看那个拖车 - 不知道是跟谁一起来的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.92,1:14:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思，我离开一小会儿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.32,1:14:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了嘛，一大勺冰激凌！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.96,1:14:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.16,1:14:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能给我点水！哦，凉快多了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.53,1:14:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.77,1:14:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我从来不漏油的，从来不
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.71,1:14:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，控制一下你自己，别出丑了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.41,1:14:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，我没给你添乱吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.75,1:15:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我输了比赛，就因为你！- 也许我能跟什么人说说…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.08,1:15:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你帮忙！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.85,1:15:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要你帮忙！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.88,1:15:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮忙…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.49,1:15:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,咣咣咣，开始啦！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.56,1:15:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，这里不是油车水镇
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.76,1:15:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我不带你到这种场合来！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.01,1:15:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍莉！芬恩！我们在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.78,1:15:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在伦敦，脱线，大本钟里面
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.65,1:15:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.65,1:15:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.06,1:15:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，这是…这都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.00,1:15:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了，脱线
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.13,1:15:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我就是傻瓜，记得吗？你说的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.20,1:15:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么时候…噢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.24,1:16:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，我那是在夸你是个出色的侦探
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.31,1:16:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是侦探！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.25,1:16:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都想告诉你们这个
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.81,1:16:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的只是辆拖车
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.02,1:16:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩，他没开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.95,1:16:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道了 - 你说的对，芬恩，我是个傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.92,1:16:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤出事都是因为我这个大傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.06,1:16:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.17,1:16:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好，你们醒了 - 正是时候
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.03,1:16:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Z教授想让你们近距离欣赏闪电麦坤之死
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.87,1:16:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还活着？- 活不长了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.41,1:16:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.88,1:16:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.85,1:16:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一打电话我们就来了 - 我想找脱线
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.89,1:16:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来都没有不在家的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.19,1:16:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,治安官去找苏格兰场了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.39,1:17:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官在联系他在英国部队的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.50,1:17:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要专心比赛就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.27,1:17:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，不过莎莉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.27,1:17:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看发生的这些事情，我不确定…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.07,1:17:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾克斯勒洛德爵士 - 抱歉打扰了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.51,1:17:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没关系 - 我只想当面谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.74,1:17:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,意大利赛之后，我本来已经绝望了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.53,1:17:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你给了我最后的希望
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.78,1:17:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.88,1:17:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也许不该这么说，但我希望你能赢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.35,1:17:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,展示给全世界看，聚合油没有问题
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.36,1:17:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线会想让你比赛的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.52,1:17:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，为了脱线
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.79,1:18:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.35,1:18:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 我不知道，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.65,1:18:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干什么了？- 我什么也没干
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.95,1:18:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘，我在和教授说话，你说什么，教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.19,1:18:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把它弄坏了！- 安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.79,1:18:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我明白了，先生，好的 - 他说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.26,1:18:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要执行后备计划了 - 后备计划？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.26,1:18:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在麦坤的维修站里放了炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.60,1:18:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次他停下来的时候，他不会说「咔嚓」了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.07,1:18:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会说「咔砰」！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.97,1:18:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别伤心了，拖车，你不可能救他的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.57,1:18:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不对，你本来可以！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.84,1:18:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的柠檬车！请求已确认
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.98,1:19:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你以为我们不会拿走你的子弹？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.72,1:19:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是，你什么都没了！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.89,1:19:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在谁是柠檬车了，嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.79,1:19:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽力了，脱线
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.20,1:19:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 枪…枪…枪… - 请求…请求…请求…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.40,1:19:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.07,1:19:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你们弄出这里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.91,1:19:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了，你得去帮麦坤
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.41,1:19:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮不了啊，我只是辆拖车
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.81,1:19:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,全看你的了，去维修站把大家救出去
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.32,1:19:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你行的 - 那你们呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.92,1:19:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会没事的 - 去弄几个新的凹痕吧，脱线
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.06,1:19:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会没事？真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.10,1:19:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果告诉他真相，他就不会走了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.77,1:19:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.27,1:19:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,死在钟的手里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.94,1:19:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,应了那句老话「你的时间到了」
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.78,1:20:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间？对了！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.92,1:20:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么？- 试试把时间拨回去
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.09,1:20:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能把电极对调就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.80,1:20:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的漂亮，脑子转得很快啊，霍莉
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.81,1:20:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么大家都在反的一边开车啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.71,1:20:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，不是吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.55,1:20:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动！紧急加速
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.29,1:20:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去赛场
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.99,1:20:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,计算最近的路线…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.63,1:20:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.76,1:20:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，灵智速小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.57,1:21:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在都是标配了 - 你们年轻人真是装备一新
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.24,1:21:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦不，这是脱线的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.17,1:21:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道他逃脱得太容易了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.92,1:21:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来！停下！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.06,1:21:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线？- 大家马上出去！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.40,1:21:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线？- 大家马上出去！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.79,1:21:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得离开维修站，你们怎么在这儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.83,1:21:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们因为你来的啊，脱线 - 一切都好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.19,1:21:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，一切都不好，这里有个炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.93,1:21:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们马上出去 - 炸弹？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.47,1:21:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线 - 芬恩！你没事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.64,1:21:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说，炸弹在你身上！他们知道你会去帮麦坤
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.60,1:21:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们昏迷的时候，他们换掉了你的空气过滤器
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.41,1:21:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊哦 - 脱线，你在这儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.15,1:21:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停在那儿！- 我一直很担心你
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.05,1:21:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别再靠近了！- 你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.82,1:21:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我不好，离我远点儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.59,1:21:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，等等！等等！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.16,1:22:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆拖车上了跑道，倒退着开！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.66,1:22:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，等等！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.13,1:22:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常紧急设备出现在跑道上意味着有事故发生
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.07,1:22:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闪电麦坤在追他！- 脱线，等等！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.83,1:22:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退！你要是离我太近了，会受重伤的！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.77,1:22:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道之前我伤害了你，不过其它都不重要了！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.71,1:22:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是最好的朋友！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.21,1:22:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤与拖车之间
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.98,1:22:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像在进行一场对话
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.88,1:22:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这拖车是谁，布伦特，不过跟你说
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.69,1:22:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定是全世界最会倒开的车
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.99,1:22:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤，你没明白，我就是炸弹！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.06,1:22:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，脱线！你是炸弹，我也想这么说！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.70,1:22:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都是炸弹，永远都是炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.27,1:22:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 躲开！- 决不！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.00,1:22:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.67,1:22:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再让你跑掉的！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.24,1:22:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,让麦坤离远点！请求已确认
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.55,1:23:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天哪
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.46,1:23:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？我在做噩梦吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.96,1:23:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤飙起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.53,1:23:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂在一辆火箭驱动的拖车后面
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.14,1:23:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.71,1:23:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授跑了！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.35,1:23:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得有人去抓麦坤 - 去抓麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.35,1:23:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 霍莉，我去抓泽达普，你去帮脱线 - 收到！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.86,1:23:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.91,1:24:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.09,1:24:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我会让你溜之大吉吗，教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.45,1:24:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦坤，放开！- 决不！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.86,1:24:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们朝你这边来了 - 我们上！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.13,1:25:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手吧，麦导弹
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.85,1:25:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线，停下！- 不可能！你会受伤的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.26,1:25:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦不
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.88,1:25:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，我们得把炸弹拆掉
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.75,1:25:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.82,1:25:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，他们在我身上绑了炸弹要杀你，这是后备计划
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.89,1:26:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,后备计划？脱线，谁在你身上放的炸弹？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.72,1:26:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！为什么我的死亡射线没杀了你？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.29,1:26:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡射线？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.70,1:26:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉炸弹，泽达普！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.10,1:26:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都这么笨啊？这是声控的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.50,1:26:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在什么都是声控的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.50,1:26:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,解除！解除！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.10,1:26:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,解除！解除！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.34,1:26:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,无效声音
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.74,1:26:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊！- 哎哟
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.41,1:26:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是忘了说
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.94,1:26:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有启动者的声音才能解除它？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.98,1:26:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说 - 解除
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.88,1:26:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,无效声音
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.29,1:26:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是启动者，还有其他人想试试吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.76,1:26:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是心有灵犀 - 他把我惹火了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.16,1:26:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么办？- 很简单，你被炸飞
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.13,1:26:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意冒一回险
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.37,1:26:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些就是想要我们命的家伙，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.97,1:26:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这与个人恩怨无关 - 伙计们，听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.54,1:26:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们经历过什么
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.61,1:26:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们也一直嘲笑我来着
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.74,1:26:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就算有权有势的野心满足了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.98,1:26:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能让你们更好受啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.28,1:27:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，不过值得一试
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.59,1:27:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,进维修站吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.00,1:27:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是今天，伙计们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.61,1:27:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.25,1:27:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢帮忙，下士
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.15,1:27:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿为老兄你的朋友效劳
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.82,1:27:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么？有什么问题？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.89,1:27:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的扳手没有一个适合这些螺栓的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.20,1:27:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了，我知道了！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.23,1:27:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么该怎么办了 - 那就赶紧呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.64,1:27:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不行，我办不到
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.90,1:27:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人拿我当真
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.94,1:28:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在知道了，这里不是油车水镇
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.54,1:28:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，是一样的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.11,1:28:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在油车水镇，你就是你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.31,1:28:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里，你还是你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.85,1:28:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果别人不拿你当真
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.12,1:28:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他们需要改变，不是你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.22,1:28:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之所以知道，是因为我以前错了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.39,1:28:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你可以办到的，你就是炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.56,1:28:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，哥们儿
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.56,1:28:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，你现在是真的炸弹，我们马上走！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.53,1:28:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对，稳住了！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.53,1:28:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.17,1:28:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 电脑！- 脱线探员请指示？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.21,1:28:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要之前让我甩掉麦坤的那个东西
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.18,1:28:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求已确认
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.95,1:28:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线？- 现在我需要你发射了！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.22,1:28:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二种，不是第一种！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.25,1:28:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,降落伞发射
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.14,1:29:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁赢了比赛啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.78,1:29:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退后！退后！- 是闪电麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.32,1:29:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不，没事的，告诉他们，脱线，解释吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.62,1:29:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.72,1:29:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人一直在破坏比赛和赛车，我知道是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.59,1:29:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，等一下，参见女王陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.03,1:29:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹！有炸弹！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.73,1:29:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有人趴下！- 退后！转移！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.44,1:29:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开主席台！快走！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.47,1:29:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！他能解除炸弹！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.61,1:29:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，我不知你要干什么，不过先退下去
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.04,1:29:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里跟油车水镇一点也不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.88,1:29:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，直接说重点
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.92,1:29:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，就是他
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.95,1:29:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我？你疯了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.09,1:29:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现你用惠特沃斯螺栓固定这些炸弹的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.12,1:29:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就明白怎么回事了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.69,1:30:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟照片上的英国引擎用的一样的螺栓
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.83,1:30:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 霍莉！放照片 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.13,1:30:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得他们是这么说老式英国引擎的：
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.87,1:30:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果下面没有漏油，就说明里面没有油
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.04,1:30:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.67,1:30:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在日本的晚会上是你在漏油
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.31,1:30:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,却栽到我头上
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.08,1:30:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,电动车根本不用油，你这个傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.71,1:30:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你伪装的，你根本没改装成电动车
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.12,1:30:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们打开引擎盖，就能看见那张照片里的引擎
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.35,1:30:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆卡车疯了！他要把我们都杀死！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.56,1:30:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.79,1:30:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可比赛是艾克斯勒洛德发起的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.05,1:30:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要伤害选手？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.76,1:30:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让聚合油看起来很危险
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.58,1:30:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样人们就会重新用汽油了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.67,1:30:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自己用伪装过的声音说的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.30,1:30:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪装的声音？你在说什么呢？你真是疯了！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.34,1:30:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一时半会儿不会有结果的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.07,1:30:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的该走了 奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.24,1:30:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等一下，我想看看会发生什么
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.71,1:30:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，是他发明了聚合油
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.68,1:30:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果他发现了巨大的油田呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.48,1:30:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在全世界都在寻找替代品的时候？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.09,1:31:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他制造出聚合油的目的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.45,1:31:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想让替代能源看起来很危险呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.99,1:31:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,「如果」？你没有证据，全都是假设吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.13,1:31:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行了，就这样吧 - 伙计们，清场
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.13,1:31:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！得有人救我！这卡车疯了！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.33,1:31:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别过来，你这个白痴！- 脱线！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.00,1:31:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱线！- 没人采取措施吗！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.17,1:31:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是疯了！解除！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.42,1:31:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是疯了！解除！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.31,1:31:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹已解除，艾克斯勒洛德爵士祝您愉快
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.19,1:31:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是照片上的引擎 - 完全吻合
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.16,1:31:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆拖车怎么会知道的？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.76,1:31:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,说定了，以后你要参加我所有的比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.16,1:31:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是你说的！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.54,1:31:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱线，我们走，该你上场了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.25,1:32:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下，请允许我
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.61,1:32:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,将大英帝国的荣誉骑士勋章
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.75,1:32:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,授予来自油车水镇的拖车脱线
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.26,1:32:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧，哥们儿
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.90,1:32:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在此授予拖车脱线爵士称号
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.27,1:32:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爵士？哇塞，您叫我脱线就行，女王陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.94,1:32:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不想听到跟「爵士」沾边的东西了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.51,1:32:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便为你们介绍一下
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.11,1:32:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王，麦坤，麦坤，女王
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.98,1:32:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤，麦导弹，麦导弹，麦坤，女王，麦导弹
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.85,1:32:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时呢，我的火箭助推器全速开动
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.96,1:32:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤不顾死活地挂在我后面
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.03,1:32:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那些卑鄙的柠檬车突然冒出来，还带着枪
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.10,1:32:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们眼看要完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.90,1:33:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就在这时，漂亮的间谍车突然出现
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.17,1:33:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,从天而降救了我们！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.27,1:33:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这故事真有意思，年轻人
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.31,1:33:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，明妮，得了吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.34,1:33:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是编的，什么火箭助推器，飞行间谍车
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.28,1:33:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，你说得很对，听起来确实有点离谱
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.88,1:33:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍莉！你来这儿干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.78,1:33:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，脱线！很高兴再见到你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.79,1:33:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.85,1:33:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的卫星收到了紧急信号？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.12,1:33:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说你收到我的邮件了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.93,1:33:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定会玩得很开心的！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.46,1:33:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，这是芬恩·麦导弹，他是秘密特工
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.40,1:33:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许告诉别人哦
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.67,1:33:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是霍莉·灵智速
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.74,1:33:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是… - 我是脱线的女朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.80,1:33:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识大家
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.87,1:33:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回圭多相信了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.18,1:33:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇，亲爱的，你身上有道很深的凹痕
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.88,1:33:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 是不是你在伦敦从天而降
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.78,1:33:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去救他们的时候给撞的？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.72,1:33:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老范！- 怎么啦？我就是问问！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.78,1:33:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，我的宝贝雷曼马上就能给你修好
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.56,1:33:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，包在我身上，放心吧，我们去拿工具
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.73,1:34:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不了，我想留着这个凹痕，它很珍贵的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.76,1:34:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍贵的凹痕？她跟脱线一样疯疯癫癫的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.03,1:34:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们俩真是天生一对
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.94,1:34:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事我不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.54,1:34:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些坏蛋不是用摄像机的光照我了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.44,1:34:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那为什么我没… - 炸成个火球？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.21,1:34:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 我们也不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.41,1:34:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的调查证实聚合油其实就是汽油
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.55,1:34:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾克斯勒洛德改造了它
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.11,1:34:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以用被射线加热时会爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.95,1:34:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，菲尔莫，你说过我的燃料是安全的！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.53,1:34:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在暗示我用了个老掉牙的借口
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.73,1:34:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把聚合油换成了我的纯天然可持续有机燃料
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.67,1:34:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是因为我从没相信过那个艾克斯勒洛德
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.94,1:34:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就大错特错了，兄弟！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.14,1:34:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他干的！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.28,1:34:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一朝当上石油巨头，永远都是石油巨头，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.41,1:34:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱树的嬉皮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.75,1:34:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,油车水镇汽车大奖赛即将开始
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.39,1:35:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有观众请离开起跑线
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.56,1:35:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都等不及要跑起来了，比赛一定很刺激！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.16,1:35:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该每年都举办一次
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.86,1:35:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，我刚想起来，我们一直没决出胜负呢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.07,1:35:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且没有媒体，没有奖杯，只有比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.70,1:35:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢这样 - 弗朗西斯科也喜欢这样
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.41,1:35:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弗朗西斯科，我向你介绍… - 莎莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.08,1:35:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.51,1:35:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤是世界上最幸运的车
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.18,1:35:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.38,1:35:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他今天有幸和弗朗西斯科一决高下！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.59,1:35:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,终点线见，麦…那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.59,1:35:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错嘛，麦坤，真有意思
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.66,1:35:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没我的那么有意思，不过还是挺有意思
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.60,1:35:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来你要干嘛？把你的挡泥板卸下来？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.90,1:35:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试好了，你会喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.70,1:35:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他也不是那么帅嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.00,1:35:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊，谢谢安慰 - 我是认真的！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.44,1:35:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就爱你这个，莎莉
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.74,1:35:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝我好运吧！- 你不需要运气！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.64,1:36:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼！那个弗朗西斯科可真帅！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.55,1:36:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧那些开放式轮胎
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.22,1:36:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，我得去喝点冷却剂了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.63,1:36:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，闪电！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.32,1:36:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油，小子们！- 跑得好，兄弟！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.09,1:36:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 追上他们，老虎！- 加油，加油！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.12,1:36:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油，麦坤，加油！- 加油，麦坤！噢嗬！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.56,1:36:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩！该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.09,1:36:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德已经加好油，挂上档，准备起飞了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.20,1:36:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们这就要走？- 我们还有其它任务
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.47,1:36:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是顺路过来捎点东西走
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.90,1:37:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你们说的一定不是车尾贴纪念品什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.71,1:37:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下亲自要求的，脱线
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.14,1:37:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可我跟你们说过了，我不是侦探 - 我们知道
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.58,1:37:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是不是侦探
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.71,1:37:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都是我认识的最聪明，最诚实的小伙子
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.38,1:37:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别忘了还有魅力非凡 - 哦，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.82,1:37:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然跟你们在一起很开心，不过…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.02,1:37:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.79,1:37:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，我们明白，不过我会回来的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.76,1:37:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还欠我第一次约会呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.73,1:37:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有什么我能帮忙的，尽管开口
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.80,1:37:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.37,1:37:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上，确实有件事
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.64,1:37:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢嗬！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.04,1:37:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！太好玩啦！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.78,1:37:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哇哇！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.26,1:37:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，脱线！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.26,1:37:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈！喔！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.00,1:38:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.40,1:38:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈哈！- 脱线！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.97,1:38:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊，他们把火箭留给我了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.64,1:38:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,终点线见，哥们儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.84,1:38:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先见到你还差不多！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.88,1:38:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！
